{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDRpUL4aZPmS1or8ms8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":223571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4410},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4-8818-8a6b8bcd7047","uuid":"6a3e5ce1-017b-408b-871d-c3d42bf21d20","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:18:44.456Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDRpBy8ZjTMz2Ln3tAA","thinking_duration_ms":54787,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDRpUL4aZPmS1or8ms8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AQbjugAFe8p8WaeG5yr1q5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221037__x61bd7e/work/WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037/game/data/lines.js","content":"/* data/lines.js: every word in the game. Tone rules: short sentences; sincere, polite, a little too personal; never a\n * wink, never a sneer; no body-size talk. A box holds 2 lines of about 60 characters. Add a line to any list: no code. */\n(() => {\n'use strict';\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.lines = {\n  boot: ['Zeroing the scale', 'Sanding the instructors', 'Counting the ducks', 'Telling the hippo'],\n  arrival: [\"You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement. The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\"],\n  motto: 'Gently, Or Not At All.',\n  tare: {\n    hello: ['Oh! Feet. Good morning, feet.', \"You came back. I wasn't worried. I was just standing here, on the floor, where I live.\", 'It has been one day since you last stepped on me. I counted it twice to be sure.',\n      'Good morning. I have been awake. I am always awake. It is fine.', \"There you are. I knew it was you. Nobody else stands like that.\", 'Welcome back. I saved your number. It was not hard. There is only one.',\n      'Hello. I heard you coming from the bungalow. That is not a comment.', 'Oh, good. I was about to start talking to the floor again.'],\n    first: ['Hello. I am Tare. I am a scale. Please step on me.', 'I will be measuring you. Please do not take it personally. I take it personally.'],\n    still: ['Please stand still. Stiller. That was the wrong way.', 'Stand still, please. Like a lamp.', 'Do not move. I will tell you when. I will not tell you when.', 'A little less of that, please.'],\n    leanTest: ['Now lean. I will watch. I am very low down.', 'Lean where I say. Do not lean where I do not say.'],\n    leanPraise: ['You lean beautifully. Like a tower people visit.', 'You put more weight on your left foot. Your right foot has noticed.', 'Your balance is very interesting. I wrote that down. I cannot write.', 'You swayed. It was a nice sway. Please do not do it again.',\n      'That was almost the same as yesterday. I remember yesterday.', 'Your right side is doing most of it. Your left side should thank it.'],\n    number: ['I am not allowed to say whether this is good. It is a number.', 'That is your number. I checked it. I am very sure of it. Please do not look at me like that.', 'Numbers are only numbers. This one is yours.', 'I have told you the number. I will not tell anybody else. I do not know anybody else.'],\n    spineDown: [\"That's younger than yesterday! Your spine has been through a lot.\", 'Younger again. I do not know how this works. I am only a scale.', 'Your spine is going backwards. This is what we want.', 'Your spine has lost a year. Do not go looking for it.'],\n    spineSame: [\"It hasn't moved. Numbers rest too.\", \"Let's call it 71. It doesn't go higher. It's not allowed.\", 'The same as yesterday. I find that restful. Do you find that restful?', 'No change. I want you to know I noticed anyway.'],\n    gertrude: [\"Gertrude's Spine Age is 19. I mention this only for the data.\", 'Gertrude is 19, in the spine. I have asked her how. She said, \"Thursday.\"', 'For comparison, Gertrude: 19. I am not comparing. I said \"for comparison\" by accident.'],\n    favorite: ['You are my favorite. You are also my only.', 'I had a dream last night. You were standing on me. It was just that.', 'I would like to say something. I have forgotten it. It was about you.', 'Do you think about me during the day? You do not have to answer. The answer is a number.'],\n    idle: ['Are you still there? I can feel you not standing on me.', 'It is quiet. I am choosing to find that relaxing.', 'I can wait. Waiting is most of what I do.', 'If you are thinking about stretching, that also counts. It does not count.'],\n    absent: 'It has been {n} days. I kept your spot warm. I am not able to generate heat.',\n    paused: \"You paused. That's {n} times today. I'm not counting. {n}.\",\n    pausedOne: 'You paused. That is fine. Everyone needs to look at something else sometimes.',\n    star0: [\"You finished. Some people don't. Those people are probably at lunch.\", \"That was not your best. I'm saying that with love, and also as data.\", 'You were there for all of it. That is what I will tell people.', 'It is not a race. If it were a race, this is the part I would not mention.'],\n    star1: ['Good effort! I could tell it was effort.', 'One star. I polished it myself. I do not have hands.', 'That was something. I have decided it was good.', 'You did that on purpose. I could tell. Well done.'],\n    star2: ['Well done. I felt that. In a good way. Mostly.', 'Two stars. That is one more than one.', 'Very nice. Please do it again sometime when I am looking. I am always looking.', 'You have improved. I noticed before anybody. There is nobody else.'],\n    star3: ['You barely moved. For a moment I thought you had left me. Please don\\'t do that.', 'Three stars. There is no fourth. I checked. I wanted to give you one.', 'Perfect. I do not know what to do with my feelings. I put them on the dial.', 'That was very good. I am going to stand here and think about it.'],\n    fall: ['You fell. That\\'s okay. The floor was expecting you.', 'That was a fall. It was a good one. You should hear it from me first.', 'The floor says hello.', 'Up you get. Nobody saw. I saw.'],\n    quit: [\"Leaving early? That's fine. I will just file this under 'Thursday.'\", 'You can stop whenever you want. I will be right here, knowing about it.', 'All right. It was almost a session.'],\n    night: [\"Sleep well. I'll be out here. In the dark. Being accurate.\", 'Good night. I will keep the number safe. Nobody will come for it.', 'Sleep on your back, or your side, or however you like. I will not be checking. I cannot reach.', 'Rest. Your spine works nights.'],\n    earlyBed: ['Bed already? It is still today. All right. I will tell today.', 'You still have sessions left. I will hold them for you. They will not keep.', 'Going to bed early is also a kind of exercise. It is not.'],\n    gerald: [\"Gerald has swallowed your minutes. He looks pleased. He always looks like that. He's ceramic.\", 'Gerald took them. He does not give them back. That is the whole arrangement.', 'Clink. That is the sound of you improving, according to Gerald.', 'Gerald does not speak, but I believe he is proud. I believe it very hard.'],\n    tips: ['Tip: Drink water. Your body is mostly water. The rest is opinions.', \"Tip: If you can't touch your toes, bring your toes closer.\", 'Tip: Stretch before bed. Or after bed. Or in bed. I am not in your bed.', 'Tip: Sitting is just standing with fewer steps.',\n      'Tip: Breathing is best done regularly. Most people have found this.', 'Tip: A short walk is a long walk that has given up early. That is also fine.', 'Tip: Stand up straight. Now stop thinking about it. Now you are thinking about it.', 'Tip: The stairs are there whether you use them or not.',\n      'Tip: Your knees are listening. Speak well of them.', 'Tip: Eat a vegetable. Any vegetable. They do not check.', 'Tip: Rest days are important. Today is not one. I looked.', 'Tip: If you feel a stretch, that is your body telling you something. Do not ask what.'],\n    gentle: \"Gentle Mode is on. I won't tell anyone. I don't know anyone.\",\n    plateau: ['We call this the plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.', 'Your number has not moved today. That is the plateau. People have camped here.', 'The plateau is very flat. That is how you know it is one.'],\n    catchup: ['Oh. Look at that. It all came at once. I knew it would. I did not know it would.', 'Your spine has caught up with you. It was only walking behind.'],\n    candleCheat: 'Did you put the controller down? I can tell. This is not that kind of stillness.',\n    nod: 'Gertrude nodded at you. I saw it. That was the reward. There is no other reward.',\n    suggest: [\"Today I suggest {a}. I don't know why. I just have a feeling. I have one feeling.\", 'My suggestion today is {a}. It pays half as much again. Gerald insisted.', 'Today, please consider {a}. I have marked the mat with a star. I had help.'],\n    bowTie: 'I am wearing a bow tie. It is because of your minutes. Please say nothing. Please notice.',\n    attract: [\"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\", 'The room is very interested. It has not said so.', 'This is called a demonstration. I am demonstrating to the floor.', 'Everybody is at lunch. I will keep going.', 'If somebody comes in, please act normal.'],\n    attractBack: \"Oh! You're back. I wasn't doing anything.\",\n    day5: ['Today is the Gentle Games. You have prepared for this. You have been here four days.', 'There will be bunting. I am told it is very gentle bunting.'],\n    gameOn: ['The Gentle Games! Everybody is very calm about it.', 'First event. Please compete gently.'],\n    class: ['A class! Several feet. I do not know where to look. I look up. Always up.', 'Everybody please stand on your own mat. I will be reading you all at once.'],\n    podium: ['I have read the results. They are all numbers. Some are larger.', 'Everybody did something. Here is who did it most.'],\n    afterDays: ['You are still here. The stay was five days. I did not want to bring it up.', 'Another day. I was not expecting you. I was expecting you.', 'Welcome back. Nothing has changed. I have been very careful about that.']\n  },\n  tareDay: ['Today I must be recalibrated. It is a routine procedure. I have been dreading it for a year.', 'Please come to Reception. The big scale is there. It is my mother. It is a very old scale.',\n    'Please stand me on her. Then press the button to read it. I will close my eyes. I am not able to close my eyes.'],\n  tareRead: ['Three grams.', \"It's the feelings. They're dense.\", 'Please do not tell Gerald. He would swallow it.', 'Thank you for reading me. Nobody has ever read me. I read everybody.'],\n  questions: [\n    { q: 'Have you recently sat?', a: ['Yes', 'Define recently'], r: ['I can tell. It was a good sit.', 'It is a word that means recently.'] },\n    { q: 'Do stairs ever surprise you?', a: ['Often', 'Only the last one'], r: ['They are very sudden.', 'It is always the last one. It is why it is last.'] },\n    { q: 'Do you make a small noise when you stand up?', a: ['Yes', 'No (this is a lie)'], r: ['Thank you for your honesty. I also hear it.', 'I have marked this down as yes.'] },\n    { q: 'On a scale of one to me, how do you feel?', a: ['One', 'Me'], r: ['I see. I will try not to be hurt.', 'That is the nicest thing anyone has said on me.'] },\n    { q: 'When did you last look at your feet?', a: ['Just now', \"I'd rather not\"], r: ['They look fine from here. I am very close to them.', 'I understand. I will keep an eye on them for you.'] },\n    { q: 'Do you know where your hips are?', a: ['Roughly', 'Who is asking'], r: ['Roughly is what most people say.', 'A scale. A scale is asking.'] },\n    { q: 'Have you thought about your posture just now?', a: ['Now I have', 'Please stop'], r: ['Everybody sits up at this point. You sat up.', 'I will stop. I have stopped. You are still sitting up.'] }\n  ],\n  reading: ['Today you weigh {d} ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.', 'You weigh {d} ducks. I weighed them twice. The ducks did not mind.', 'Today: {d} ducks. Do not picture them. Now you are picturing them.', 'The reading is {d} ducks. A goose would be different. Please do not ask about the goose.'],\n  ending: {\n    reveal: ['I should tell you something.', \"The card. The one that wasn't signed. That was me.\", \"I don't have hands. It took three years.\", \"I sent one to everybody. You're the one who came.\"],\n    leave: [\"Now step off. Go on. I'll be here.\", \"I'm a scale. That's the whole job.\"],\n    low: 'Gertrude says you may have the hat. She has another one. She has been waiting since Thursday.',\n    mid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.',\n    high: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.',\n    free: 'The Institute is open. It was always open. The door does not lock. I would have told you, but you did not ask.'\n  },\n  gertrudeWin: \"Well done, dear. I've been waiting since Thursday.\",\n  gertrudeLose: \"That's all right, dear. I had a head start. I started in 1961.\",\n  duel: ['Gull!', 'That is a blender. Do not look at the blender.', 'A conga line. They are being very gentle about it.', 'Fireworks. Somebody has been saving them.', 'I will now sing. I have been practising. It is one note.', 'Goose. I told you about the goose.'],\n  duelTare: 'La. La. La. La. La. La. La.',\n  sign: { laundry: 'Please do not walk on the laundry line. Walking on the laundry line: 10:30 daily.', iron: 'You Have Been Doing That Wrong', mirror: 'Objects In Mirror Are You', juice: 'Juice. Ask About The Olive.', reception: 'Please Wait To Be Measured', pier: 'Aerobics Pier. Mind The Gulls.', deck: 'Quiet Please. Quieter.', mount: 'Mount Posture. Elevation: Good.' },\n  thoughts: ['Did you lock the door?', 'What is a lumbar?', 'Is that my knee?', 'Dennis.', 'You left the stove on in 2014.', 'Who sent that card?', 'Am I breathing right now?', 'Now I\\'m breathing on purpose.', 'Olive?', 'Do hippos sleep?', 'What is the goose doing?', 'Is it still Thursday?'],\n  birch: {\n    voice: 'birch', name: 'Birch',\n    hello: \"Welcome. I am Birch. I'm made of wood, so I will be very patient and slightly warped.\",\n    breathe: \"Breathe in. ...I don't breathe. But I've read about it, and it sounds very good.\",\n    demo: ['Keep your back straight. Mine was sanded.', 'Nice. Now hold that until it stops being nice.', \"You're shaking. This means it's working. Or you're cold.\", 'Watch me once. I will do it slowly. I do everything slowly.', 'I have held this pose since the shop.', 'It is simple. I will not say easy. I am a professional.'],\n    more: 'Two more. I said that two reps ago. It is still true.',\n    moreFirst: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n    other: 'Other way. The hoop does not mind. Your hips may have a view.',\n    lean: 'Lean toward the ring. Slowly. I have been told I am slow. It was a compliment.',\n    hold: 'Hold. Good. Now keep doing that, forever, or until I say.',\n    recover: 'A gull has landed on you. Do not be flattered. Lean away from it.',\n    good: 'Good. That was good. I do not say this often. I do not say many things.',\n    tired: 'You look tired. I do not get tired. I get damp.'\n  },\n  alder: {\n    voice: 'alder', name: 'Alder',\n    hello: \"Hello! I'm Alder. I was a tree, and then I was a lot of very small decisions.\",\n    breathe: 'And breathe in! Lovely. You look like someone breathing.',\n    demo: [\"Wonderful! You're doing so well. Please stop shaking.\", \"Everybody's body is different. Yours is the one wobbling.\", \"Let's hold this for a moment. A moment is eleven seconds.\", 'Smile. It relaxes the jaw. ...Not like that.', \"This next pose is the Stork. I knew a stork. We didn't speak.\", 'Follow me! I am very easy to follow. I have no knees to speak of.'],\n    more: 'Two more! You did not hear me say that earlier, but I thought it.',\n    moreFirst: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n    other: 'Other way! Your hips will thank you. They will not. They do not speak.',\n    lean: 'Lean over to the ring! Lovely. A little more. That is too much. Lovely.',\n    hold: 'Hold it there! You are doing it. You are still doing it. You are very still doing it.',\n    recover: 'Oh! A gull. How nice for you. Lean the other way, please!',\n    good: 'That was wonderful! I have been told to say that. It was also true.',\n    tired: \"You look tired! That's the muscles saying thank you. Please stop them.\"\n  },\n  regulars: {\n    gertrude: { name: 'Gertrude', voice: 'gertrude', lines: [\"You're doing fine, dear. I've been standing here since Thursday.\", \"I'm eighty-seven. My spine is nineteen. We don't really talk.\", 'Stand up straight, dear. Not for me. I just like to see it.', 'I had a hat like yours. I have it still. I have all the hats.', 'I do not do the exercises any more. I only do the standing.'] },\n    dennis: { name: 'Dennis', voice: 'dennis', lines: [\"I'm only here for the blender. Don't tell the scale.\", 'Olive?', 'People ask why the olives. I ask why the people.', 'I used to exercise. It was a Tuesday.', 'This juice has never been near a fruit. It is very calming.'] },\n    marisol: { name: 'Marisol', voice: 'marisol', lines: [\"Morning! I've already done today. I'm on to tomorrow.\", \"Keep your cadence up! I don't know what yours is. Keep it up.\", \"I ran around the island twice while you read this.\", \"Tomorrow's weather is lovely. I was just there.\"] },\n    kevin: { name: 'Young Kevin', voice: 'kevin', lines: ['Everybody calls me Young Kevin. There was an older Kevin. We don\\'t talk about how he got so flexible.', \"I'm fifty-two. It's a very young fifty-two.\", \"I'm thinking of taking up the rope. I have been thinking of it for nine years.\"] },\n    okafor: { name: 'Mr. Okafor', voice: 'okafor', lines: ['A hoop is just a circle that believes in you.', 'Hips first! Everything else will catch up. Or it will not. Hips first!', 'This shirt is called Tuesday in the Tropics. I have a Wednesday as well.'] },\n    lou: { name: 'Lou', voice: 'lou', lines: [\"I'm on a five-minute break. It's been a good one. Three years in March.\", 'Wake me if anything changes. Nothing will. That is why I chose this bench.', 'They tell me this bench is very good for the back. I have not checked.'] },\n    twins: { name: 'The Twins', voice: 'twins', lines: [\"We're not related.\", \"We've checked.\", 'We do everything at the same time. We have not discussed it.', 'People say we look alike. We do not see it. We do not look at each other.'] }\n  },\n  slalomTimes: [['Gertrude', 58, 'She walked.'], ['Marisol', 41, 'Uphill, she says.'], ['Young Kevin', 73, 'He stopped to rest.'], ['Lou', 600, 'He is still on the chairlift.']],\n  wardrobe: { towel: 'Towel', headband: 'Headband', sunhat: 'Sunhat', hat: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\" },\n  nicknames: ['Gentle Doug', 'Sir Slouch', 'Ms. Almost', 'The Other Pat', 'Big Linda', 'Mostly Paul', 'Tall Enough Ann', 'Soft Gary', 'Dame Tilt', 'Uncle Maybe', 'Quiet Sue', 'Young Barry', 'Nearly Nora', 'Wobbly Ted', 'Madame Pause', 'Lord Lumbar'],\n  class: { titles: ['Most Still', 'Best Wobble', 'Participated', 'Also There'], join: 'Press Start on a pad, or 2 on the keyboard, to take a mat.' },\n  hubTitles: { Stillness: 'Most Still', Strength: 'Best Form', Cardio: 'Most Cardio', Balance: 'Best Wobble' }\n};\n\n/** pick a line from a list, never the same one twice running. A path: 'tare.hello' or a list */\nconst lastPick = {};\nlet lineRng = null;\nG.line = (path, vars) => {\n  const list = typeof path === 'string' ? path.split('.').reduce((o, k) => o && o[k], G.DATA.lines) : path;\n  let s;\n  if (Array.isArray(list)) {\n    lineRng = lineRng || G.E.rng(4711);\n    let i = Math.floor(lineRng() * list.length) % list.length;\n    if (list.length > 1 && lastPick[path] === i) i = (i + 1) % list.length;\n    lastPick[path] = i; s = list[i];\n  } else s = list;\n  if (s === undefined) s = '';\n  if (vars) for (const k in vars) s = s.split('{' + k + '}').join(vars[k]);\n  return s;\n};\n})();\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":223571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4410},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4-8818-8a6b8bcd7047","uuid":"90ba3e07-aada-46b3-ab3e-c18e9f7ac550","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:20:05.587Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDRpBy8ZjTMz2Ln3tAA","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01AQbjugAFe8p8WaeG5yr1q5":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221037__x61bd7e/work/WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037/game/data/lines.js","content":"/* data/lines.js: every word in the game. Tone rules: short sentences; sincere, polite, a little too personal; never a\n * wink, never a sneer; no body-size talk. A box holds 2 lines of about 60 characters. Add a line to any list: no code. */\n(() => {\n'use strict';\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.lines = {\n  boot: ['Zeroing the scale', 'Sanding the instructors', 'Counting the ducks', 'Telling the hippo'],\n  arrival: [\"You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement. The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\"],\n  motto: 'Gently, Or Not At All.',\n  tare: {\n    hello: ['Oh! Feet. Good morning, feet.', \"You came back. I wasn't worried. I was just standing here, on the floor, where I live.\", 'It has been one day since you last stepped on me. I counted it twice to be sure.',\n      'Good morning. I have been awake. I am always awake. It is fine.', \"There you are. I knew it was you. Nobody else stands like that.\", 'Welcome back. I saved your number. It was not hard. There is only one.',\n      'Hello. I heard you coming from the bungalow. That is not a comment.', 'Oh, good. I was about to start talking to the floor again.'],\n    first: ['Hello. I am Tare. I am a scale. Please step on me.', 'I will be measuring you. Please do not take it personally. I take it personally.'],\n    still: ['Please stand still. Stiller. That was the wrong way.', 'Stand still, please. Like a lamp.', 'Do not move. I will tell you when. I will not tell you when.', 'A little less of that, please.'],\n    leanTest: ['Now lean. I will watch. I am very low down.', 'Lean where I say. Do not lean where I do not say.'],\n    leanPraise: ['You lean beautifully. Like a tower people visit.', 'You put more weight on your left foot. Your right foot has noticed.', 'Your balance is very interesting. I wrote that down. I cannot write.', 'You swayed. It was a nice sway. Please do not do it again.',\n      'That was almost the same as yesterday. I remember yesterday.', 'Your right side is doing most of it. Your left side should thank it.'],\n    number: ['I am not allowed to say whether this is good. It is a number.', 'That is your number. I checked it. I am very sure of it. Please do not look at me like that.', 'Numbers are only numbers. This one is yours.', 'I have told you the number. I will not tell anybody else. I do not know anybody else.'],\n    spineDown: [\"That's younger than yesterday! Your spine has been through a lot.\", 'Younger again. I do not know how this works. I am only a scale.', 'Your spine is going backwards. This is what we want.', 'Your spine has lost a year. Do not go looking for it.'],\n    spineSame: [\"It hasn't moved. Numbers rest too.\", \"Let's call it 71. It doesn't go higher. It's not allowed.\", 'The same as yesterday. I find that restful. Do you find that restful?', 'No change. I want you to know I noticed anyway.'],\n    gertrude: [\"Gertrude's Spine Age is 19. I mention this only for the data.\", 'Gertrude is 19, in the spine. I have asked her how. She said, \"Thursday.\"', 'For comparison, Gertrude: 19. I am not comparing. I said \"for comparison\" by accident.'],\n    favorite: ['You are my favorite. You are also my only.', 'I had a dream last night. You were standing on me. It was just that.', 'I would like to say something. I have forgotten it. It was about you.', 'Do you think about me during the day? You do not have to answer. The answer is a number.'],\n    idle: ['Are you still there? I can feel you not standing on me.', 'It is quiet. I am choosing to find that relaxing.', 'I can wait. Waiting is most of what I do.', 'If you are thinking about stretching, that also counts. It does not count.'],\n    absent: 'It has been {n} days. I kept your spot warm. I am not able to generate heat.',\n    paused: \"You paused. That's {n} times today. I'm not counting. {n}.\",\n    pausedOne: 'You paused. That is fine. Everyone needs to look at something else sometimes.',\n    star0: [\"You finished. Some people don't. Those people are probably at lunch.\", \"That was not your best. I'm saying that with love, and also as data.\", 'You were there for all of it. That is what I will tell people.', 'It is not a race. If it were a race, this is the part I would not mention.'],\n    star1: ['Good effort! I could tell it was effort.', 'One star. I polished it myself. I do not have hands.', 'That was something. I have decided it was good.', 'You did that on purpose. I could tell. Well done.'],\n    star2: ['Well done. I felt that. In a good way. Mostly.', 'Two stars. That is one more than one.', 'Very nice. Please do it again sometime when I am looking. I am always looking.', 'You have improved. I noticed before anybody. There is nobody else.'],\n    star3: ['You barely moved. For a moment I thought you had left me. Please don\\'t do that.', 'Three stars. There is no fourth. I checked. I wanted to give you one.', 'Perfect. I do not know what to do with my feelings. I put them on the dial.', 'That was very good. I am going to stand here and think about it.'],\n    fall: ['You fell. That\\'s okay. The floor was expecting you.', 'That was a fall. It was a good one. You should hear it from me first.', 'The floor says hello.', 'Up you get. Nobody saw. I saw.'],\n    quit: [\"Leaving early? That's fine. I will just file this under 'Thursday.'\", 'You can stop whenever you want. I will be right here, knowing about it.', 'All right. It was almost a session.'],\n    night: [\"Sleep well. I'll be out here. In the dark. Being accurate.\", 'Good night. I will keep the number safe. Nobody will come for it.', 'Sleep on your back, or your side, or however you like. I will not be checking. I cannot reach.', 'Rest. Your spine works nights.'],\n    earlyBed: ['Bed already? It is still today. All right. I will tell today.', 'You still have sessions left. I will hold them for you. They will not keep.', 'Going to bed early is also a kind of exercise. It is not.'],\n    gerald: [\"Gerald has swallowed your minutes. He looks pleased. He always looks like that. He's ceramic.\", 'Gerald took them. He does not give them back. That is the whole arrangement.', 'Clink. That is the sound of you improving, according to Gerald.', 'Gerald does not speak, but I believe he is proud. I believe it very hard.'],\n    tips: ['Tip: Drink water. Your body is mostly water. The rest is opinions.', \"Tip: If you can't touch your toes, bring your toes closer.\", 'Tip: Stretch before bed. Or after bed. Or in bed. I am not in your bed.', 'Tip: Sitting is just standing with fewer steps.',\n      'Tip: Breathing is best done regularly. Most people have found this.', 'Tip: A short walk is a long walk that has given up early. That is also fine.', 'Tip: Stand up straight. Now stop thinking about it. Now you are thinking about it.', 'Tip: The stairs are there whether you use them or not.',\n      'Tip: Your knees are listening. Speak well of them.', 'Tip: Eat a vegetable. Any vegetable. They do not check.', 'Tip: Rest days are important. Today is not one. I looked.', 'Tip: If you feel a stretch, that is your body telling you something. Do not ask what.'],\n    gentle: \"Gentle Mode is on. I won't tell anyone. I don't know anyone.\",\n    plateau: ['We call this the plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.', 'Your number has not moved today. That is the plateau. People have camped here.', 'The plateau is very flat. That is how you know it is one.'],\n    catchup: ['Oh. Look at that. It all came at once. I knew it would. I did not know it would.', 'Your spine has caught up with you. It was only walking behind.'],\n    candleCheat: 'Did you put the controller down? I can tell. This is not that kind of stillness.',\n    nod: 'Gertrude nodded at you. I saw it. That was the reward. There is no other reward.',\n    suggest: [\"Today I suggest {a}. I don't know why. I just have a feeling. I have one feeling.\", 'My suggestion today is {a}. It pays half as much again. Gerald insisted.', 'Today, please consider {a}. I have marked the mat with a star. I had help.'],\n    bowTie: 'I am wearing a bow tie. It is because of your minutes. Please say nothing. Please notice.',\n    attract: [\"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\", 'The room is very interested. It has not said so.', 'This is called a demonstration. I am demonstrating to the floor.', 'Everybody is at lunch. I will keep going.', 'If somebody comes in, please act normal.'],\n    attractBack: \"Oh! You're back. I wasn't doing anything.\",\n    day5: ['Today is the Gentle Games. You have prepared for this. You have been here four days.', 'There will be bunting. I am told it is very gentle bunting.'],\n    gameOn: ['The Gentle Games! Everybody is very calm about it.', 'First event. Please compete gently.'],\n    class: ['A class! Several feet. I do not know where to look. I look up. Always up.', 'Everybody please stand on your own mat. I will be reading you all at once.'],\n    podium: ['I have read the results. They are all numbers. Some are larger.', 'Everybody did something. Here is who did it most.'],\n    afterDays: ['You are still here. The stay was five days. I did not want to bring it up.', 'Another day. I was not expecting you. I was expecting you.', 'Welcome back. Nothing has changed. I have been very careful about that.']\n  },\n  tareDay: ['Today I must be recalibrated. It is a routine procedure. I have been dreading it for a year.', 'Please come to Reception. The big scale is there. It is my mother. It is a very old scale.',\n    'Please stand me on her. Then press the button to read it. I will close my eyes. I am not able to close my eyes.'],\n  tareRead: ['Three grams.', \"It's the feelings. They're dense.\", 'Please do not tell Gerald. He would swallow it.', 'Thank you for reading me. Nobody has ever read me. I read everybody.'],\n  questions: [\n    { q: 'Have you recently sat?', a: ['Yes', 'Define recently'], r: ['I can tell. It was a good sit.', 'It is a word that means recently.'] },\n    { q: 'Do stairs ever surprise you?', a: ['Often', 'Only the last one'], r: ['They are very sudden.', 'It is always the last one. It is why it is last.'] },\n    { q: 'Do you make a small noise when you stand up?', a: ['Yes', 'No (this is a lie)'], r: ['Thank you for your honesty. I also hear it.', 'I have marked this down as yes.'] },\n    { q: 'On a scale of one to me, how do you feel?', a: ['One', 'Me'], r: ['I see. I will try not to be hurt.', 'That is the nicest thing anyone has said on me.'] },\n    { q: 'When did you last look at your feet?', a: ['Just now', \"I'd rather not\"], r: ['They look fine from here. I am very close to them.', 'I understand. I will keep an eye on them for you.'] },\n    { q: 'Do you know where your hips are?', a: ['Roughly', 'Who is asking'], r: ['Roughly is what most people say.', 'A scale. A scale is asking.'] },\n    { q: 'Have you thought about your posture just now?', a: ['Now I have', 'Please stop'], r: ['Everybody sits up at this point. You sat up.', 'I will stop. I have stopped. You are still sitting up.'] }\n  ],\n  reading: ['Today you weigh {d} ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.', 'You weigh {d} ducks. I weighed them twice. The ducks did not mind.', 'Today: {d} ducks. Do not picture them. Now you are picturing them.', 'The reading is {d} ducks. A goose would be different. Please do not ask about the goose.'],\n  ending: {\n    reveal: ['I should tell you something.', \"The card. The one that wasn't signed. That was me.\", \"I don't have hands. It took three years.\", \"I sent one to everybody. You're the one who came.\"],\n    leave: [\"Now step off. Go on. I'll be here.\", \"I'm a scale. That's the whole job.\"],\n    low: 'Gertrude says you may have the hat. She has another one. She has been waiting since Thursday.',\n    mid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.',\n    high: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.',\n    free: 'The Institute is open. It was always open. The door does not lock. I would have told you, but you did not ask.'\n  },\n  gertrudeWin: \"Well done, dear. I've been waiting since Thursday.\",\n  gertrudeLose: \"That's all right, dear. I had a head start. I started in 1961.\",\n  duel: ['Gull!', 'That is a blender. Do not look at the blender.', 'A conga line. They are being very gentle about it.', 'Fireworks. Somebody has been saving them.', 'I will now sing. I have been practising. It is one note.', 'Goose. I told you about the goose.'],\n  duelTare: 'La. La. La. La. La. La. La.',\n  sign: { laundry: 'Please do not walk on the laundry line. Walking on the laundry line: 10:30 daily.', iron: 'You Have Been Doing That Wrong', mirror: 'Objects In Mirror Are You', juice: 'Juice. Ask About The Olive.', reception: 'Please Wait To Be Measured', pier: 'Aerobics Pier. Mind The Gulls.', deck: 'Quiet Please. Quieter.', mount: 'Mount Posture. Elevation: Good.' },\n  thoughts: ['Did you lock the door?', 'What is a lumbar?', 'Is that my knee?', 'Dennis.', 'You left the stove on in 2014.', 'Who sent that card?', 'Am I breathing right now?', 'Now I\\'m breathing on purpose.', 'Olive?', 'Do hippos sleep?', 'What is the goose doing?', 'Is it still Thursday?'],\n  birch: {\n    voice: 'birch', name: 'Birch',\n    hello: \"Welcome. I am Birch. I'm made of wood, so I will be very patient and slightly warped.\",\n    breathe: \"Breathe in. ...I don't breathe. But I've read about it, and it sounds very good.\",\n    demo: ['Keep your back straight. Mine was sanded.', 'Nice. Now hold that until it stops being nice.', \"You're shaking. This means it's working. Or you're cold.\", 'Watch me once. I will do it slowly. I do everything slowly.', 'I have held this pose since the shop.', 'It is simple. I will not say easy. I am a professional.'],\n    more: 'Two more. I said that two reps ago. It is still true.',\n    moreFirst: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n    other: 'Other way. The hoop does not mind. Your hips may have a view.',\n    lean: 'Lean toward the ring. Slowly. I have been told I am slow. It was a compliment.',\n    hold: 'Hold. Good. Now keep doing that, forever, or until I say.',\n    recover: 'A gull has landed on you. Do not be flattered. Lean away from it.',\n    good: 'Good. That was good. I do not say this often. I do not say many things.',\n    tired: 'You look tired. I do not get tired. I get damp.'\n  },\n  alder: {\n    voice: 'alder', name: 'Alder',\n    hello: \"Hello! I'm Alder. I was a tree, and then I was a lot of very small decisions.\",\n    breathe: 'And breathe in! Lovely. You look like someone breathing.',\n    demo: [\"Wonderful! You're doing so well. Please stop shaking.\", \"Everybody's body is different. Yours is the one wobbling.\", \"Let's hold this for a moment. A moment is eleven seconds.\", 'Smile. It relaxes the jaw. ...Not like that.', \"This next pose is the Stork. I knew a stork. We didn't speak.\", 'Follow me! I am very easy to follow. I have no knees to speak of.'],\n    more: 'Two more! You did not hear me say that earlier, but I thought it.',\n    moreFirst: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n    other: 'Other way! Your hips will thank you. They will not. They do not speak.',\n    lean: 'Lean over to the ring! Lovely. A little more. That is too much. Lovely.',\n    hold: 'Hold it there! You are doing it. You are still doing it. You are very still doing it.',\n    recover: 'Oh! A gull. How nice for you. Lean the other way, please!',\n    good: 'That was wonderful! I have been told to say that. It was also true.',\n    tired: \"You look tired! That's the muscles saying thank you. Please stop them.\"\n  },\n  regulars: {\n    gertrude: { name: 'Gertrude', voice: 'gertrude', lines: [\"You're doing fine, dear. I've been standing here since Thursday.\", \"I'm eighty-seven. My spine is nineteen. We don't really talk.\", 'Stand up straight, dear. Not for me. I just like to see it.', 'I had a hat like yours. I have it still. I have all the hats.', 'I do not do the exercises any more. I only do the standing.'] },\n    dennis: { name: 'Dennis', voice: 'dennis', lines: [\"I'm only here for the blender. Don't tell the scale.\", 'Olive?', 'People ask why the olives. I ask why the people.', 'I used to exercise. It was a Tuesday.', 'This juice has never been near a fruit. It is very calming.'] },\n    marisol: { name: 'Marisol', voice: 'marisol', lines: [\"Morning! I've already done today. I'm on to tomorrow.\", \"Keep your cadence up! I don't know what yours is. Keep it up.\", \"I ran around the island twice while you read this.\", \"Tomorrow's weather is lovely. I was just there.\"] },\n    kevin: { name: 'Young Kevin', voice: 'kevin', lines: ['Everybody calls me Young Kevin. There was an older Kevin. We don\\'t talk about how he got so flexible.', \"I'm fifty-two. It's a very young fifty-two.\", \"I'm thinking of taking up the rope. I have been thinking of it for nine years.\"] },\n    okafor: { name: 'Mr. Okafor', voice: 'okafor', lines: ['A hoop is just a circle that believes in you.', 'Hips first! Everything else will catch up. Or it will not. Hips first!', 'This shirt is called Tuesday in the Tropics. I have a Wednesday as well.'] },\n    lou: { name: 'Lou', voice: 'lou', lines: [\"I'm on a five-minute break. It's been a good one. Three years in March.\", 'Wake me if anything changes. Nothing will. That is why I chose this bench.', 'They tell me this bench is very good for the back. I have not checked.'] },\n    twins: { name: 'The Twins', voice: 'twins', lines: [\"We're not related.\", \"We've checked.\", 'We do everything at the same time. We have not discussed it.', 'People say we look alike. We do not see it. We do not look at each other.'] }\n  },\n  slalomTimes: [['Gertrude', 58, 'She walked.'], ['Marisol', 41, 'Uphill, she says.'], ['Young Kevin', 73, 'He stopped to rest.'], ['Lou', 600, 'He is still on the chairlift.']],\n  wardrobe: { towel: 'Towel', headband: 'Headband', sunhat: 'Sunhat', hat: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\" },\n  nicknames: ['Gentle Doug', 'Sir Slouch', 'Ms. Almost', 'The Other Pat', 'Big Linda', 'Mostly Paul', 'Tall Enough Ann', 'Soft Gary', 'Dame Tilt', 'Uncle Maybe', 'Quiet Sue', 'Young Barry', 'Nearly Nora', 'Wobbly Ted', 'Madame Pause', 'Lord Lumbar'],\n  class: { titles: ['Most Still', 'Best Wobble', 'Participated', 'Also There'], join: 'Press Start on a pad, or 2 on the keyboard, to take a mat.' },\n  hubTitles: { Stillness: 'Most Still', Strength: 'Best Form', Cardio: 'Most Cardio', Balance: 'Best Wobble' }\n};\n\n/** pick a line from a list, never the same one twice running. A path: 'tare.hello' or a list */\nconst lastPick = {};\nlet lineRng = null;\nG.line = (path, vars) => {\n  const list = typeof path === 'string' ? path.split('.').reduce((o, k) => o && o[k], G.DATA.lines) : path;\n  let s;\n  if (Array.isArray(list)) {\n    lineRng = lineRng || G.E.rng(4711);\n    let i = Math.floor(lineRng() * list.length) % list.length;\n    if (list.length > 1 && lastPick[path] === i) i = (i + 1) % list.length;\n    lastPick[path] = i; s = list[i];\n  } else s = list;\n  if (s === undefined) s = '';\n  if (vars) for (const k in vars) s = s.split('{' + k + '}').join(vars[k]);\n  return s;\n};\n})();\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AQbjugAFe8p8WaeG5yr1q5","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221037__x61bd7e/work/WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037/game/data/lines.js (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4-8818-8a6b8bcd7047","uuid":"a25ab504-d21e-4bcf-bc4a-bac3c662d796","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:20:05.602Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221037__x61bd7e/work/WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037/game/data/lines.js","content":"/* data/lines.js: every word in the game. Tone rules: short sentences; sincere, polite, a little too personal; never a\n * wink, never a sneer; no body-size talk. A box holds 2 lines of about 60 characters. Add a line to any list: no code. */\n(() => {\n'use strict';\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.lines = {\n  boot: ['Zeroing the scale', 'Sanding the instructors', 'Counting the ducks', 'Telling the hippo'],\n  arrival: [\"You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement. The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\"],\n  motto: 'Gently, Or Not At All.',\n  tare: {\n    hello: ['Oh! Feet. Good morning, feet.', \"You came back. I wasn't worried. I was just standing here, on the floor, where I live.\", 'It has been one day since you last stepped on me. I counted it twice to be sure.',\n      'Good morning. I have been awake. I am always awake. It is fine.', \"There you are. I knew it was you. Nobody else stands like that.\", 'Welcome back. I saved your number. It was not hard. There is only one.',\n      'Hello. I heard you coming from the bungalow. That is not a comment.', 'Oh, good. I was about to start talking to the floor again.'],\n    first: ['Hello. I am Tare. I am a scale. Please step on me.', 'I will be measuring you. Please do not take it personally. I take it personally.'],\n    still: ['Please stand still. Stiller. That was the wrong way.', 'Stand still, please. Like a lamp.', 'Do not move. I will tell you when. I will not tell you when.', 'A little less of that, please.'],\n    leanTest: ['Now lean. I will watch. I am very low down.', 'Lean where I say. Do not lean where I do not say.'],\n    leanPraise: ['You lean beautifully. Like a tower people visit.', 'You put more weight on your left foot. Your right foot has noticed.', 'Your balance is very interesting. I wrote that down. I cannot write.', 'You swayed. It was a nice sway. Please do not do it again.',\n      'That was almost the same as yesterday. I remember yesterday.', 'Your right side is doing most of it. Your left side should thank it.'],\n    number: ['I am not allowed to say whether this is good. It is a number.', 'That is your number. I checked it. I am very sure of it. Please do not look at me like that.', 'Numbers are only numbers. This one is yours.', 'I have told you the number. I will not tell anybody else. I do not know anybody else.'],\n    spineDown: [\"That's younger than yesterday! Your spine has been through a lot.\", 'Younger again. I do not know how this works. I am only a scale.', 'Your spine is going backwards. This is what we want.', 'Your spine has lost a year. Do not go looking for it.'],\n    spineSame: [\"It hasn't moved. Numbers rest too.\", \"Let's call it 71. It doesn't go higher. It's not allowed.\", 'The same as yesterday. I find that restful. Do you find that restful?', 'No change. I want you to know I noticed anyway.'],\n    gertrude: [\"Gertrude's Spine Age is 19. I mention this only for the data.\", 'Gertrude is 19, in the spine. I have asked her how. She said, \"Thursday.\"', 'For comparison, Gertrude: 19. I am not comparing. I said \"for comparison\" by accident.'],\n    favorite: ['You are my favorite. You are also my only.', 'I had a dream last night. You were standing on me. It was just that.', 'I would like to say something. I have forgotten it. It was about you.', 'Do you think about me during the day? You do not have to answer. The answer is a number.'],\n    idle: ['Are you still there? I can feel you not standing on me.', 'It is quiet. I am choosing to find that relaxing.', 'I can wait. Waiting is most of what I do.', 'If you are thinking about stretching, that also counts. It does not count.'],\n    absent: 'It has been {n} days. I kept your spot warm. I am not able to generate heat.',\n    paused: \"You paused. That's {n} times today. I'm not counting. {n}.\",\n    pausedOne: 'You paused. That is fine. Everyone needs to look at something else sometimes.',\n    star0: [\"You finished. Some people don't. Those people are probably at lunch.\", \"That was not your best. I'm saying that with love, and also as data.\", 'You were there for all of it. That is what I will tell people.', 'It is not a race. If it were a race, this is the part I would not mention.'],\n    star1: ['Good effort! I could tell it was effort.', 'One star. I polished it myself. I do not have hands.', 'That was something. I have decided it was good.', 'You did that on purpose. I could tell. Well done.'],\n    star2: ['Well done. I felt that. In a good way. Mostly.', 'Two stars. That is one more than one.', 'Very nice. Please do it again sometime when I am looking. I am always looking.', 'You have improved. I noticed before anybody. There is nobody else.'],\n    star3: ['You barely moved. For a moment I thought you had left me. Please don\\'t do that.', 'Three stars. There is no fourth. I checked. I wanted to give you one.', 'Perfect. I do not know what to do with my feelings. I put them on the dial.', 'That was very good. I am going to stand here and think about it.'],\n    fall: ['You fell. That\\'s okay. The floor was expecting you.', 'That was a fall. It was a good one. You should hear it from me first.', 'The floor says hello.', 'Up you get. Nobody saw. I saw.'],\n    quit: [\"Leaving early? That's fine. I will just file this under 'Thursday.'\", 'You can stop whenever you want. I will be right here, knowing about it.', 'All right. It was almost a session.'],\n    night: [\"Sleep well. I'll be out here. In the dark. Being accurate.\", 'Good night. I will keep the number safe. Nobody will come for it.', 'Sleep on your back, or your side, or however you like. I will not be checking. I cannot reach.', 'Rest. Your spine works nights.'],\n    earlyBed: ['Bed already? It is still today. All right. I will tell today.', 'You still have sessions left. I will hold them for you. They will not keep.', 'Going to bed early is also a kind of exercise. It is not.'],\n    gerald: [\"Gerald has swallowed your minutes. He looks pleased. He always looks like that. He's ceramic.\", 'Gerald took them. He does not give them back. That is the whole arrangement.', 'Clink. That is the sound of you improving, according to Gerald.', 'Gerald does not speak, but I believe he is proud. I believe it very hard.'],\n    tips: ['Tip: Drink water. Your body is mostly water. The rest is opinions.', \"Tip: If you can't touch your toes, bring your toes closer.\", 'Tip: Stretch before bed. Or after bed. Or in bed. I am not in your bed.', 'Tip: Sitting is just standing with fewer steps.',\n      'Tip: Breathing is best done regularly. Most people have found this.', 'Tip: A short walk is a long walk that has given up early. That is also fine.', 'Tip: Stand up straight. Now stop thinking about it. Now you are thinking about it.', 'Tip: The stairs are there whether you use them or not.',\n      'Tip: Your knees are listening. Speak well of them.', 'Tip: Eat a vegetable. Any vegetable. They do not check.', 'Tip: Rest days are important. Today is not one. I looked.', 'Tip: If you feel a stretch, that is your body telling you something. Do not ask what.'],\n    gentle: \"Gentle Mode is on. I won't tell anyone. I don't know anyone.\",\n    plateau: ['We call this the plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.', 'Your number has not moved today. That is the plateau. People have camped here.', 'The plateau is very flat. That is how you know it is one.'],\n    catchup: ['Oh. Look at that. It all came at once. I knew it would. I did not know it would.', 'Your spine has caught up with you. It was only walking behind.'],\n    candleCheat: 'Did you put the controller down? I can tell. This is not that kind of stillness.',\n    nod: 'Gertrude nodded at you. I saw it. That was the reward. There is no other reward.',\n    suggest: [\"Today I suggest {a}. I don't know why. I just have a feeling. I have one feeling.\", 'My suggestion today is {a}. It pays half as much again. Gerald insisted.', 'Today, please consider {a}. I have marked the mat with a star. I had help.'],\n    bowTie: 'I am wearing a bow tie. It is because of your minutes. Please say nothing. Please notice.',\n    attract: [\"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\", 'The room is very interested. It has not said so.', 'This is called a demonstration. I am demonstrating to the floor.', 'Everybody is at lunch. I will keep going.', 'If somebody comes in, please act normal.'],\n    attractBack: \"Oh! You're back. I wasn't doing anything.\",\n    day5: ['Today is the Gentle Games. You have prepared for this. You have been here four days.', 'There will be bunting. I am told it is very gentle bunting.'],\n    gameOn: ['The Gentle Games! Everybody is very calm about it.', 'First event. Please compete gently.'],\n    class: ['A class! Several feet. I do not know where to look. I look up. Always up.', 'Everybody please stand on your own mat. I will be reading you all at once.'],\n    podium: ['I have read the results. They are all numbers. Some are larger.', 'Everybody did something. Here is who did it most.'],\n    afterDays: ['You are still here. The stay was five days. I did not want to bring it up.', 'Another day. I was not expecting you. I was expecting you.', 'Welcome back. Nothing has changed. I have been very careful about that.']\n  },\n  tareDay: ['Today I must be recalibrated. It is a routine procedure. I have been dreading it for a year.', 'Please come to Reception. The big scale is there. It is my mother. It is a very old scale.',\n    'Please stand me on her. Then press the button to read it. I will close my eyes. I am not able to close my eyes.'],\n  tareRead: ['Three grams.', \"It's the feelings. They're dense.\", 'Please do not tell Gerald. He would swallow it.', 'Thank you for reading me. Nobody has ever read me. I read everybody.'],\n  questions: [\n    { q: 'Have you recently sat?', a: ['Yes', 'Define recently'], r: ['I can tell. It was a good sit.', 'It is a word that means recently.'] },\n    { q: 'Do stairs ever surprise you?', a: ['Often', 'Only the last one'], r: ['They are very sudden.', 'It is always the last one. It is why it is last.'] },\n    { q: 'Do you make a small noise when you stand up?', a: ['Yes', 'No (this is a lie)'], r: ['Thank you for your honesty. I also hear it.', 'I have marked this down as yes.'] },\n    { q: 'On a scale of one to me, how do you feel?', a: ['One', 'Me'], r: ['I see. I will try not to be hurt.', 'That is the nicest thing anyone has said on me.'] },\n    { q: 'When did you last look at your feet?', a: ['Just now', \"I'd rather not\"], r: ['They look fine from here. I am very close to them.', 'I understand. I will keep an eye on them for you.'] },\n    { q: 'Do you know where your hips are?', a: ['Roughly', 'Who is asking'], r: ['Roughly is what most people say.', 'A scale. A scale is asking.'] },\n    { q: 'Have you thought about your posture just now?', a: ['Now I have', 'Please stop'], r: ['Everybody sits up at this point. You sat up.', 'I will stop. I have stopped. You are still sitting up.'] }\n  ],\n  reading: ['Today you weigh {d} ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.', 'You weigh {d} ducks. I weighed them twice. The ducks did not mind.', 'Today: {d} ducks. Do not picture them. Now you are picturing them.', 'The reading is {d} ducks. A goose would be different. Please do not ask about the goose.'],\n  ending: {\n    reveal: ['I should tell you something.', \"The card. The one that wasn't signed. That was me.\", \"I don't have hands. It took three years.\", \"I sent one to everybody. You're the one who came.\"],\n    leave: [\"Now step off. Go on. I'll be here.\", \"I'm a scale. That's the whole job.\"],\n    low: 'Gertrude says you may have the hat. She has another one. She has been waiting since Thursday.',\n    mid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.',\n    high: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.',\n    free: 'The Institute is open. It was always open. The door does not lock. I would have told you, but you did not ask.'\n  },\n  gertrudeWin: \"Well done, dear. I've been waiting since Thursday.\",\n  gertrudeLose: \"That's all right, dear. I had a head start. I started in 1961.\",\n  duel: ['Gull!', 'That is a blender. Do not look at the blender.', 'A conga line. They are being very gentle about it.', 'Fireworks. Somebody has been saving them.', 'I will now sing. I have been practising. It is one note.', 'Goose. I told you about the goose.'],\n  duelTare: 'La. La. La. La. La. La. La.',\n  sign: { laundry: 'Please do not walk on the laundry line. Walking on the laundry line: 10:30 daily.', iron: 'You Have Been Doing That Wrong', mirror: 'Objects In Mirror Are You', juice: 'Juice. Ask About The Olive.', reception: 'Please Wait To Be Measured', pier: 'Aerobics Pier. Mind The Gulls.', deck: 'Quiet Please. Quieter.', mount: 'Mount Posture. Elevation: Good.' },\n  thoughts: ['Did you lock the door?', 'What is a lumbar?', 'Is that my knee?', 'Dennis.', 'You left the stove on in 2014.', 'Who sent that card?', 'Am I breathing right now?', 'Now I\\'m breathing on purpose.', 'Olive?', 'Do hippos sleep?', 'What is the goose doing?', 'Is it still Thursday?'],\n  birch: {\n    voice: 'birch', name: 'Birch',\n    hello: \"Welcome. I am Birch. I'm made of wood, so I will be very patient and slightly warped.\",\n    breathe: \"Breathe in. ...I don't breathe. But I've read about it, and it sounds very good.\",\n    demo: ['Keep your back straight. Mine was sanded.', 'Nice. Now hold that until it stops being nice.', \"You're shaking. This means it's working. Or you're cold.\", 'Watch me once. I will do it slowly. I do everything slowly.', 'I have held this pose since the shop.', 'It is simple. I will not say easy. I am a professional.'],\n    more: 'Two more. I said that two reps ago. It is still true.',\n    moreFirst: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n    other: 'Other way. The hoop does not mind. Your hips may have a view.',\n    lean: 'Lean toward the ring. Slowly. I have been told I am slow. It was a compliment.',\n    hold: 'Hold. Good. Now keep doing that, forever, or until I say.',\n    recover: 'A gull has landed on you. Do not be flattered. Lean away from it.',\n    good: 'Good. That was good. I do not say this often. I do not say many things.',\n    tired: 'You look tired. I do not get tired. I get damp.'\n  },\n  alder: {\n    voice: 'alder', name: 'Alder',\n    hello: \"Hello! I'm Alder. I was a tree, and then I was a lot of very small decisions.\",\n    breathe: 'And breathe in! Lovely. You look like someone breathing.',\n    demo: [\"Wonderful! You're doing so well. Please stop shaking.\", \"Everybody's body is different. Yours is the one wobbling.\", \"Let's hold this for a moment. A moment is eleven seconds.\", 'Smile. It relaxes the jaw. ...Not like that.', \"This next pose is the Stork. I knew a stork. We didn't speak.\", 'Follow me! I am very easy to follow. I have no knees to speak of.'],\n    more: 'Two more! You did not hear me say that earlier, but I thought it.',\n    moreFirst: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n    other: 'Other way! Your hips will thank you. They will not. They do not speak.',\n    lean: 'Lean over to the ring! Lovely. A little more. That is too much. Lovely.',\n    hold: 'Hold it there! You are doing it. You are still doing it. You are very still doing it.',\n    recover: 'Oh! A gull. How nice for you. Lean the other way, please!',\n    good: 'That was wonderful! I have been told to say that. It was also true.',\n    tired: \"You look tired! That's the muscles saying thank you. Please stop them.\"\n  },\n  regulars: {\n    gertrude: { name: 'Gertrude', voice: 'gertrude', lines: [\"You're doing fine, dear. I've been standing here since Thursday.\", \"I'm eighty-seven. My spine is nineteen. We don't really talk.\", 'Stand up straight, dear. Not for me. I just like to see it.', 'I had a hat like yours. I have it still. I have all the hats.', 'I do not do the exercises any more. I only do the standing.'] },\n    dennis: { name: 'Dennis', voice: 'dennis', lines: [\"I'm only here for the blender. Don't tell the scale.\", 'Olive?', 'People ask why the olives. I ask why the people.', 'I used to exercise. It was a Tuesday.', 'This juice has never been near a fruit. It is very calming.'] },\n    marisol: { name: 'Marisol', voice: 'marisol', lines: [\"Morning! I've already done today. I'm on to tomorrow.\", \"Keep your cadence up! I don't know what yours is. Keep it up.\", \"I ran around the island twice while you read this.\", \"Tomorrow's weather is lovely. I was just there.\"] },\n    kevin: { name: 'Young Kevin', voice: 'kevin', lines: ['Everybody calls me Young Kevin. There was an older Kevin. We don\\'t talk about how he got so flexible.', \"I'm fifty-two. It's a very young fifty-two.\", \"I'm thinking of taking up the rope. I have been thinking of it for nine years.\"] },\n    okafor: { name: 'Mr. Okafor', voice: 'okafor', lines: ['A hoop is just a circle that believes in you.', 'Hips first! Everything else will catch up. Or it will not. Hips first!', 'This shirt is called Tuesday in the Tropics. I have a Wednesday as well.'] },\n    lou: { name: 'Lou', voice: 'lou', lines: [\"I'm on a five-minute break. It's been a good one. Three years in March.\", 'Wake me if anything changes. Nothing will. That is why I chose this bench.', 'They tell me this bench is very good for the back. I have not checked.'] },\n    twins: { name: 'The Twins', voice: 'twins', lines: [\"We're not related.\", \"We've checked.\", 'We do everything at the same time. We have not discussed it.', 'People say we look alike. We do not see it. We do not look at each other.'] }\n  },\n  slalomTimes: [['Gertrude', 58, 'She walked.'], ['Marisol', 41, 'Uphill, she says.'], ['Young Kevin', 73, 'He stopped to rest.'], ['Lou', 600, 'He is still on the chairlift.']],\n  wardrobe: { towel: 'Towel', headband: 'Headband', sunhat: 'Sunhat', hat: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\" },\n  nicknames: ['Gentle Doug', 'Sir Slouch', 'Ms. Almost', 'The Other Pat', 'Big Linda', 'Mostly Paul', 'Tall Enough Ann', 'Soft Gary', 'Dame Tilt', 'Uncle Maybe', 'Quiet Sue', 'Young Barry', 'Nearly Nora', 'Wobbly Ted', 'Madame Pause', 'Lord Lumbar'],\n  class: { titles: ['Most Still', 'Best Wobble', 'Participated', 'Also There'], join: 'Press Start on a pad, or 2 on the keyboard, to take a mat.' },\n  hubTitles: { Stillness: 'Most Still', Strength: 'Best Form', Cardio: 'Most Cardio', Balance: 'Best Wobble' }\n};\n\n/** pick a line from a list, never the same one twice running. A path: 'tare.hello' or a list */\nconst lastPick = {};\nlet lineRng = null;\nG.line = (path, vars) => {\n  const list = typeof path === 'string' ? path.split('.').reduce((o, k) => o && o[k], G.DATA.lines) : path;\n  let s;\n  if (Array.isArray(list)) {\n    lineRng = lineRng || G.E.rng(4711);\n    let i = Math.floor(lineRng() * list.length) % list.length;\n    if (list.length > 1 && lastPick[path] === i) i = (i + 1) % list.length;\n    lastPick[path] = i; s = list[i];\n  } else s = list;\n  if (s === undefined) s = '';\n  if (vars) for (const k in vars) s = s.split('{' + k + '}').join(vars[k]);\n  return s;\n};\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AQbjugAFe8p8WaeG5yr1q5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDRpUL4aZPmS1or8ms8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DtBPaSSHjXSDpH9eziUQQ7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > game/data/poses.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/poses.js: named poses, a window inside a clip and the way the body faces. The Pose Viewer in Dev Mode prints a row. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.poses = {\n  stork:    { clip: '111_39_part1', a: 3.6, b: 7.0, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Stork' },\n  knee:     { clip: '111_39_part2', a: .5,  b: 2.4, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Knee Lift' },\n  triangle: { clip: '111_39_part3', a: 2.2, b: 5.2, tgt: 1.2,  name: 'Triangle' },\n  warrior:  { clip: '111_39_part3', a: 6.6, b: 7.6, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Warrior' },\n  lunge:    { clip: '111_38_part1', a: 2.9, b: 5.0, tgt: .25,  name: 'Low Lunge' },\n  dog:      { clip: '111_38_part2', a: 2.8, b: 5.2, tgt: .25,  name: 'Down Dog' },\n  fold:     { clip: '111_38_part2', a: 8.0, b: 8.8, tgt: .25,  name: 'Forward Fold' },\n  plank:    { clip: '111_41_part3', a: 3.4, b: 6.4, tgt: .25,  name: 'Low Plank' },\n  sit:      { clip: 'Meditate',     a: 1.2, b: 3.2, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Cross-Legged' },\n  stand:    { clip: 'Idle_Subtle',  a: 0,   b: 2,   tgt: 1.57, name: 'Standing' }\n};\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/charts.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/charts.js: step charts, a string a lane (left, down, up, right), 16 steps a bar. '.' alone is an empty lane. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G, E16 = '................';\nG.DATA.charts = {\n  stepA: { song: 'stepA', parts: {\n    I: [E16, E16, E16, E16],\n    A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'],\n    B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '..x...x.....x...'.replace('..x...x.....x...', '............x...')],\n    C: ['x.......x...x...', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'.replace('....x.......x...', '....x...........')],\n    D: ['x...............', '.', '.', '....x...x...x...'] },\n    order: 'I A A B A A C B D A A B C A B A' },\n  stepB: { song: 'stepB', parts: {\n    I: [E16, E16, E16, E16],\n    A: ['x.......x.......', '....x...........', '............x...', '.'],\n    B: ['x...........x...', '........x.......', '....x...........', '.'],\n    C: ['x...............', '....x...x.......', '............x...', '..x...........x.'.replace('..x...........x.', '..............x.')],\n    D: ['x.......x.......', '..x...........x.', '......x.........', '....x.......x...'],\n    E: ['x...x...........', '........x.......', '..........x.....', '............x...'] },\n    order: 'I A B A C B D A E C D B E A D C E D A B' },\n  // the Class's and a hub round's chart: two lanes, four bars of each\n  stepClass: { song: 'stepA', parts: {\n    I: [E16, E16, E16, E16],\n    A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'],\n    B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '............x...'] },\n    order: 'I A A B A B A A B A B A B A B A B' }\n};\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/courses.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/courses.js: slalom gates (x offsets from the fall line, in order), obstacles, jog road stretches, laundry spans. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.courses = {\n  slalom: [\n    { name: 'Mount Posture', gateWidth: 52, spacing: 700, par: 52, worst: 92, fog: null,\n      gates: [0, 60, -50, 70, -30, -90, 40, 100, 20, -70, -120, -40, 50, 110, 60, -20, -90, 0],\n      obstacles: [[120, 0, 'pine'], [-110, 1, 'snowman'], [10, 2.5, 'snowman'], [-140, 4, 'pine'], [130, 6, 'pine'], [-10, 7.5, 'snowman'], [-60, 10.5, 'pine'], [10, 12.5, 'snowman'], [150, 14, 'pine'], [-150, 15.5, 'pine'], [40, 16.5, 'snowman']] },\n    { name: 'Mount Posture, North Face', gateWidth: 40, spacing: 660, par: 54, worst: 96, fog: { color: '#e6f0f4', near: 240, far: 900 },\n      gates: [0, 80, -60, 90, -70, -120, 50, 130, 30, -90, -140, -40, 80, 140, 40, -60, -130, 10],\n      obstacles: [[150, 0, 'pine'], [-140, 1, 'snowman'], [20, 2.5, 'snowman'], [-20, 3.5, 'pine'], [170, 6, 'pine'], [-30, 7.5, 'snowman'], [-60, 10.5, 'pine'], [30, 12.5, 'snowman'], [175, 13.5, 'pine'], [-170, 15.5, 'pine'], [10, 16.5, 'snowman'], [-40, 5.5, 'snowman']] }\n  ],\n  jog: {\n    stretches: [[30, {}], [50, { curve: 2.5 }], [40, { hill: 800 }], [50, { curve: -3, hill: -800 }], [30, {}], [60, { curve: 3.5 }], [40, { hill: 600 }], [50, { curve: -2.5, hill: -600 }], [50, {}]],\n    pigeonsEvery: 900, joggersEvery: 3200, cupsEvery: 1500\n  },\n  laundry: {\n    spans: [\n      { len: 460, pegs: [150, 300], gusts: [.25, .7] },\n      { len: 520, pegs: [120, 260, 400], gusts: [.2, .55, .85] },\n      { len: 580, pegs: [110, 230, 350, 470], gusts: [.15, .45, .7, .9] }\n    ],\n    par: 62, worst: 118\n  }\n};\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/trays.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/trays.js: tea tray layouts as text. o olive, G glass, B bumper, # wall block, ~ gap (an olive that falls in comes\n * back to its start), K gecko path start. A cell is 16 units. Three trays make a run. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.trays = [\n  { rows: [\n    '............',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '............',\n    '.o...##...G.',\n    '.....##.....',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '............' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '............',\n    '.o...B....G.',\n    '.........~~.',\n    '.o...~~.....',\n    '.....~~...G.',\n    '.o...B......',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.o..........' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.....B......',\n    '.o..##..~...',\n    '.o..##....G.',\n    '.o.......B..',\n    '.o..K.....G.',\n    '.....~~.....',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.o..........' ] }\n];\nG.DATA.traysHard = [\n  { rows: [\n    '.o...~....G.',\n    '.....~......',\n    '.o.B.~..B.G.',\n    '............',\n    '.o...~....G.',\n    '.....~......' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '.o..B.....G.',\n    '......~~....',\n    '.o..##..~.G.',\n    '.o..##......',\n    '.......B..G.',\n    '.o..~~......',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.o..........' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '.o...B....G.',\n    '.........~..',\n    '.o.##..B..G.',\n    '.o.##.......',\n    '.o....~~..G.',\n    '.o.K..~~....',\n    '.o.......BG.',\n    '............',\n    '.o........G.' ] }\n];\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/days.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/days.js: the five days. opens: activities that open that morning. Add a day here with no code. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.days = [\n  { day: 1, name: 'Orientation', opens: ['stork', 'squat', 'step', 'tray'], guided: 'stork' },\n  { day: 2, name: 'Improvement', opens: ['flow', 'pushup', 'hoop', 'laundry'], nod: true },\n  { day: 3, name: 'The Plateau', opens: ['candle', 'lunge', 'jog', 'slalom'], hold: true },\n  { day: 4, name: \"Tare's Day\", opens: [], tier2: true, catchUp: true, scene: 'tareday' },\n  { day: 5, name: 'The Gentle Games', opens: [], tier2: true, games: true, shortCheck: true },\n  { day: 6, name: 'After', opens: [], tier2: true, after: true }\n];\nG.DATA.dayOf = d => G.DATA.days[Math.min(d, G.DATA.days.length) - 1];\nG.DATA.openOn = id => { const row = G.DATA.days.find(d => d.opens.includes(id)); return row ? row.day : 1; };\nG.DATA.games = { list: ['stork', 'step', 'slalom'], dur: 30, duel: 90 };\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/unlocks.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/unlocks.js: what Gerald's minutes open. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.unlocks = [\n  { id: 'towel', minutes: 5, name: 'Towel', say: 'A towel. Gerald found it. Please do not ask where he keeps things.', wear: true },\n  { id: 'headband', minutes: 10, name: 'Headband', say: 'A headband. It holds your head in. That is what they are for.', wear: true },\n  { id: 'sunhat', minutes: 15, name: 'Sunhat', say: 'A sunhat. For the sun. It is the same sun as before.', wear: true },\n  { id: 'bowtie', minutes: 20, name: 'Tiny bow tie', say: 'I am wearing a bow tie. It is because of your minutes. Please say nothing. Please notice.' },\n  { id: 'hat', minutes: 25, name: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\", say: \"Gertrude's spare hat. It is warm. She only took it off this morning.\", wear: true },\n  { id: 'friend', minutes: 30, name: \"Gerald's friend\", say: 'Gerald has a friend now. It is a smaller hippo. There is no explanation.' }\n];\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/activities.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/activities.js: one row an activity. family: which code runs it (game/activities/). tiers: its numbers.\n * Add a tier or an activity from an existing family here, with no code. Rows become G.activity entries in runtime.js. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.activities = [\n  /* ---- Stillness ---- */\n  { id: 'stork', family: 'hold', discipline: 'Stillness', name: 'Stork Stand', view: 'brawler', room: 'deck', music: 'yoga', class: true, hub: true, dur: 45, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Stand on one leg. Keep the dot in the ring. You can lean. You cannot leave.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [\n      { name: 'Stork Stand', set: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, pushV: .6, pushEvery: 7 }, ringEvery: 12, ringReach: .22, gull: { at: [15, 31], force: 2.5, stay: 6 }, poses: ['stork'] },\n      { name: 'Eyes Closed', blind: true, set: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, pushV: .7, pushEvery: 6 }, ringEvery: 99, ringReach: 0, gull: { at: [20], force: 2, stay: 6 }, poses: ['stork'], say: 'The same, with your eyes closed. Listen to the tone. Feel the shaking. Believe me.' }\n    ] },\n  { id: 'flow', family: 'hold', discipline: 'Stillness', name: 'Sun Flow', view: 'brawler', room: 'deck', music: 'yoga', dur: 80, stars: [.5, .75, .92], breath: true, mirror: true,\n    say: 'Five poses, two breaths each. Breathe with the ring. Hold still in between. You may not skip the Warrior.', controls: ['lean', 'breath'],\n    tiers: [\n      { name: 'Sun Flow', set: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, pushV: .5, pushEvery: 9 }, ringEvery: 16, ringReach: .12, poses: ['lunge', 'dog', 'triangle', 'warrior', 'stork'], breaths: [4, 4] },\n      { name: 'Long Exhale', set: { k: 11, c: 5, s: 10, A: 3.6, nf: 1.5, R: .22, pushV: .6, pushEvery: 7 }, ringEvery: 16, ringReach: .16, poses: ['fold', 'plank', 'dog', 'knee', 'warrior'], breaths: [3, 5], say: 'A shorter breath in, a longer breath out. It is the same breath, but you will notice it more.' }\n    ] },\n  { id: 'candle', family: 'candle', discipline: 'Stillness', name: 'Quiet Candle', view: 'brawler', room: 'deck', music: 'yoga', class: true, hub: true, dur: 60, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Sit. A candle burns. Move gently, or it goes out. Thoughts will push you. Do not follow them far.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [\n      { name: 'Quiet Candle', set: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, pushV: .55, pushEvery: 5 }, thoughtEvery: 9, thoughtForce: [3, 5] },\n      { name: 'Noisy Candle', set: { k: 10, c: 4.5, s: 13, A: 1.8, nf: .9, R: .18, pushV: .6, pushEvery: 4.5 }, thoughtEvery: 7, thoughtForce: [3.5, 5.5], extras: ['blender', 'goose'], say: 'The same candle. Today Dennis is using the blender. There is also a goose.' }\n    ] },\n  /* ---- Strength: one code path, three rows ---- */\n  { id: 'squat', family: 'rep', discipline: 'Strength', name: 'Squat Rail', view: 'brawler', room: 'iron', music: 'iron', class: true, hub: true, stars: [.35, .65, .90], axis: 'y', facing: 1.2,\n    clip: '22_14', top: 1.1, bottom: 1.72,\n    say: 'The bead rides the rail. Your lean is your knees. Go down with it, come up with it. Stay straight.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Squat Rail', reps: 8, down: 2, up: 2, hold: 0 }, { name: 'Slow Squat', reps: 12, down: 3, up: 1, hold: .8, say: 'Three seconds down. A hold. One second up. It has a name. The name is not polite.' } ] },\n  { id: 'pushup', family: 'rep', discipline: 'Strength', name: 'Push-Up', view: 'brawler', room: 'iron', music: 'iron', hub: true, stars: [.35, .65, .90], axis: 'y', facing: .1,\n    clip: 'Pushup', top: 0, bottomShare: .5,\n    say: 'Lower yourself as the bead lowers. Rise as it rises. The floor is not going anywhere.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Push-Up', reps: 6, down: 2, up: 2, hold: 0 }, { name: 'Slow Push-Up', reps: 10, down: 3, up: 1, hold: .8, say: 'Slower this time. I am told it builds character. I am a scale, and I have plenty.' } ] },\n  { id: 'lunge', family: 'rep', discipline: 'Strength', name: 'Side Lunge', view: 'brawler', room: 'iron', music: 'iron', stars: [.35, .65, .90], axis: 'x', facing: 1.57, bodyMove: 'sideLunge',\n    say: 'The bead swings left and right. Lean with it. Your feet stay where they are. That is the whole idea.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Side Lunge', reps: 8, down: 2, up: 2, hold: 0 }, { name: 'Long Lunge', reps: 12, down: 3, up: 1, hold: .8, say: 'Further and slower. Your feet have been told. Please tell your knees.' } ] },\n  /* ---- Cardio ---- */\n  { id: 'step', family: 'step', discipline: 'Cardio', name: 'Step Class', view: 'brawler', room: 'pier', music: null, class: true, hub: true, dur: 60, stars: [.5, .75, .92],\n    say: 'Step on the beat. Left, right, left, right. Everyone behind you will follow. Nobody blames you.', controls: ['steps'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Step Class', chart: 'stepA', lanes: 2 }, { name: 'Step Class Two', chart: 'stepB', lanes: 4, say: 'All four directions. Faster. Please do not fall off the pier. We have only the one.' } ] },\n  { id: 'hoop', family: 'hoop', discipline: 'Cardio', name: 'Hoop Hips', view: 'brawler', room: 'pier', music: 'festival', class: true, hub: true, dur: 60, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Circle your lean to spin the hoop. Not too slow, not too eager. Catch the hoops they throw you.', controls: ['circle', 'catch'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Hoop Hips', tossEvery: 8, needMore: .3 }, { name: 'Hoop Hips Deluxe', tossEvery: 5.5, needMore: .6, swap: 2, say: 'More hoops, more often, and the direction will change twice. Mr. Okafor has been waiting for this.' } ] },\n  { id: 'jog', family: 'jog', discipline: 'Cardio', name: 'Coastal Jog', view: 'side', room: null, music: 'jog', hub: true, dur: 95, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: \"Left, right, left, right, at Marisol's pace. Lean to steer round the pigeons. Grab the water.\", controls: ['pace', 'steer'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Coastal Jog', length: 1, pigeons: 1, band: 1 }, { name: 'The Long Way', length: 1.25, pigeons: 1.8, band: .75, say: 'The same coast, more of it, and more pigeons. They have heard about you.' } ] },\n  /* ---- Balance games ---- */\n  { id: 'slalom', family: 'slalom', discipline: 'Balance', name: 'Mount Posture Slalom', short: 'Slalom', view: 'side', room: null, music: 'ski', hub: true, dur: 120, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Lean left and right through the gates. Forward to tuck. Back to brake. Please avoid the snowmen.', controls: ['ski'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Mount Posture Slalom', course: 0 }, { name: 'North Face', course: 1, say: 'Narrower gates, and fog. The North Face is the same mountain, only less friendly.' } ] },\n  { id: 'tray', family: 'tray', discipline: 'Balance', name: 'Tray Service', view: 'tray', room: null, music: 'tray', dur: 60, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Dennis needs olives in glasses. He cannot say why. Lean to tilt the tray and roll them in.', controls: ['tilt'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Tray Service', trays: 'trays', dur: 60, set: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 0, A: .25, nf: 1, R: .3 } }, { name: 'Evening Service', trays: 'traysHard', dur: 60, set: { k: 14, c: 6, s: 2, A: .6, nf: 1.3, R: .3 }, friction: .35, say: 'The same olives, but it is evening. The tray has more holes. Nobody knows who is doing that.' } ] },\n  { id: 'laundry', family: 'laundry', discipline: 'Balance', name: 'Laundry Line', view: 'side', room: null, music: 'laundry', dur: 118, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Walk the line. Keep the dot in the ring. Hop over the pegs. The wind will warn you. Please walk on it.', controls: ['walk', 'leanx', 'jump'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Laundry Line', set: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, pushV: .9, pushEvery: 5 }, gust: 9, course: 0 }, { name: 'Windy Washday', set: { k: 10, c: 3.2, s: 18, A: 3.8, nf: 1.3, R: .36, pushV: 1, pushEvery: 4.5 }, gust: 11, course: 0, say: 'A windier day. It is also Monday, which is when the big sheets go out.' } ] }\n];\n// (the Body Check's set, and the Gentle Games' short versions, live with their scenes' data)\nG.DATA.bodyCheck = { set: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20 } };\n})();\nEOF\nsed -n 4690,4726p engine/my-3d2dge.js | grep -n \"HUMANOID_HATS\\|cap:\\|band:\" | cut -c1-500 | head; grep -n \"const HUMANOID_HATS\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | cut -c1-200; L=$(grep -n \"const HUMANOID_HATS\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"$L,$((L+6))p\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | cut -c1-600; grep -n \"draw.over\\|o.draw\\b\\|\\.draw\\.over\\|draw.under\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | head -5 | cut -c1-300","description":"Write the game data files and check hat internals"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":223571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4410},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4-8818-8a6b8bcd7047","uuid":"fb3a45a2-4525-4d20-9dc6-6c367c0d2654","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:21:12.823Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDRpBy8ZjTMz2Ln3tAA","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01DtBPaSSHjXSDpH9eziUQQ7":{"command":"cat > game/data/poses.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/poses.js: named poses, a window inside a clip and the way the body faces. The Pose Viewer in Dev Mode prints a row. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.poses = {\n  stork:    { clip: '111_39_part1', a: 3.6, b: 7.0, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Stork' },\n  knee:     { clip: '111_39_part2', a: .5,  b: 2.4, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Knee Lift' },\n  triangle: { clip: '111_39_part3', a: 2.2, b: 5.2, tgt: 1.2,  name: 'Triangle' },\n  warrior:  { clip: '111_39_part3', a: 6.6, b: 7.6, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Warrior' },\n  lunge:    { clip: '111_38_part1', a: 2.9, b: 5.0, tgt: .25,  name: 'Low Lunge' },\n  dog:      { clip: '111_38_part2', a: 2.8, b: 5.2, tgt: .25,  name: 'Down Dog' },\n  fold:     { clip: '111_38_part2', a: 8.0, b: 8.8, tgt: .25,  name: 'Forward Fold' },\n  plank:    { clip: '111_41_part3', a: 3.4, b: 6.4, tgt: .25,  name: 'Low Plank' },\n  sit:      { clip: 'Meditate',     a: 1.2, b: 3.2, tgt: 1.57, name: 'Cross-Legged' },\n  stand:    { clip: 'Idle_Subtle',  a: 0,   b: 2,   tgt: 1.57, name: 'Standing' }\n};\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/charts.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/charts.js: step charts, a string a lane (left, down, up, right), 16 steps a bar. '.' alone is an empty lane. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G, E16 = '................';\nG.DATA.charts = {\n  stepA: { song: 'stepA', parts: {\n    I: [E16, E16, E16, E16],\n    A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'],\n    B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '..x...x.....x...'.replace('..x...x.....x...', '............x...')],\n    C: ['x.......x...x...', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'.replace('....x.......x...', '....x...........')],\n    D: ['x...............', '.', '.', '....x...x...x...'] },\n    order: 'I A A B A A C B D A A B C A B A' },\n  stepB: { song: 'stepB', parts: {\n    I: [E16, E16, E16, E16],\n    A: ['x.......x.......', '....x...........', '............x...', '.'],\n    B: ['x...........x...', '........x.......', '....x...........', '.'],\n    C: ['x...............', '....x...x.......', '............x...', '..x...........x.'.replace('..x...........x.', '..............x.')],\n    D: ['x.......x.......', '..x...........x.', '......x.........', '....x.......x...'],\n    E: ['x...x...........', '........x.......', '..........x.....', '............x...'] },\n    order: 'I A B A C B D A E C D B E A D C E D A B' },\n  // the Class's and a hub round's chart: two lanes, four bars of each\n  stepClass: { song: 'stepA', parts: {\n    I: [E16, E16, E16, E16],\n    A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'],\n    B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '............x...'] },\n    order: 'I A A B A B A A B A B A B A B A B' }\n};\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/courses.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/courses.js: slalom gates (x offsets from the fall line, in order), obstacles, jog road stretches, laundry spans. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.courses = {\n  slalom: [\n    { name: 'Mount Posture', gateWidth: 52, spacing: 700, par: 52, worst: 92, fog: null,\n      gates: [0, 60, -50, 70, -30, -90, 40, 100, 20, -70, -120, -40, 50, 110, 60, -20, -90, 0],\n      obstacles: [[120, 0, 'pine'], [-110, 1, 'snowman'], [10, 2.5, 'snowman'], [-140, 4, 'pine'], [130, 6, 'pine'], [-10, 7.5, 'snowman'], [-60, 10.5, 'pine'], [10, 12.5, 'snowman'], [150, 14, 'pine'], [-150, 15.5, 'pine'], [40, 16.5, 'snowman']] },\n    { name: 'Mount Posture, North Face', gateWidth: 40, spacing: 660, par: 54, worst: 96, fog: { color: '#e6f0f4', near: 240, far: 900 },\n      gates: [0, 80, -60, 90, -70, -120, 50, 130, 30, -90, -140, -40, 80, 140, 40, -60, -130, 10],\n      obstacles: [[150, 0, 'pine'], [-140, 1, 'snowman'], [20, 2.5, 'snowman'], [-20, 3.5, 'pine'], [170, 6, 'pine'], [-30, 7.5, 'snowman'], [-60, 10.5, 'pine'], [30, 12.5, 'snowman'], [175, 13.5, 'pine'], [-170, 15.5, 'pine'], [10, 16.5, 'snowman'], [-40, 5.5, 'snowman']] }\n  ],\n  jog: {\n    stretches: [[30, {}], [50, { curve: 2.5 }], [40, { hill: 800 }], [50, { curve: -3, hill: -800 }], [30, {}], [60, { curve: 3.5 }], [40, { hill: 600 }], [50, { curve: -2.5, hill: -600 }], [50, {}]],\n    pigeonsEvery: 900, joggersEvery: 3200, cupsEvery: 1500\n  },\n  laundry: {\n    spans: [\n      { len: 460, pegs: [150, 300], gusts: [.25, .7] },\n      { len: 520, pegs: [120, 260, 400], gusts: [.2, .55, .85] },\n      { len: 580, pegs: [110, 230, 350, 470], gusts: [.15, .45, .7, .9] }\n    ],\n    par: 62, worst: 118\n  }\n};\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/trays.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/trays.js: tea tray layouts as text. o olive, G glass, B bumper, # wall block, ~ gap (an olive that falls in comes\n * back to its start), K gecko path start. A cell is 16 units. Three trays make a run. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.trays = [\n  { rows: [\n    '............',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '............',\n    '.o...##...G.',\n    '.....##.....',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '............' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '............',\n    '.o...B....G.',\n    '.........~~.',\n    '.o...~~.....',\n    '.....~~...G.',\n    '.o...B......',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.o..........' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.....B......',\n    '.o..##..~...',\n    '.o..##....G.',\n    '.o.......B..',\n    '.o..K.....G.',\n    '.....~~.....',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.o..........' ] }\n];\nG.DATA.traysHard = [\n  { rows: [\n    '.o...~....G.',\n    '.....~......',\n    '.o.B.~..B.G.',\n    '............',\n    '.o...~....G.',\n    '.....~......' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '.o..B.....G.',\n    '......~~....',\n    '.o..##..~.G.',\n    '.o..##......',\n    '.......B..G.',\n    '.o..~~......',\n    '.o........G.',\n    '.o..........' ] },\n  { rows: [\n    '.o...B....G.',\n    '.........~..',\n    '.o.##..B..G.',\n    '.o.##.......',\n    '.o....~~..G.',\n    '.o.K..~~....',\n    '.o.......BG.',\n    '............',\n    '.o........G.' ] }\n];\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/days.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/days.js: the five days. opens: activities that open that morning. Add a day here with no code. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.days = [\n  { day: 1, name: 'Orientation', opens: ['stork', 'squat', 'step', 'tray'], guided: 'stork' },\n  { day: 2, name: 'Improvement', opens: ['flow', 'pushup', 'hoop', 'laundry'], nod: true },\n  { day: 3, name: 'The Plateau', opens: ['candle', 'lunge', 'jog', 'slalom'], hold: true },\n  { day: 4, name: \"Tare's Day\", opens: [], tier2: true, catchUp: true, scene: 'tareday' },\n  { day: 5, name: 'The Gentle Games', opens: [], tier2: true, games: true, shortCheck: true },\n  { day: 6, name: 'After', opens: [], tier2: true, after: true }\n];\nG.DATA.dayOf = d => G.DATA.days[Math.min(d, G.DATA.days.length) - 1];\nG.DATA.openOn = id => { const row = G.DATA.days.find(d => d.opens.includes(id)); return row ? row.day : 1; };\nG.DATA.games = { list: ['stork', 'step', 'slalom'], dur: 30, duel: 90 };\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/unlocks.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/unlocks.js: what Gerald's minutes open. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.unlocks = [\n  { id: 'towel', minutes: 5, name: 'Towel', say: 'A towel. Gerald found it. Please do not ask where he keeps things.', wear: true },\n  { id: 'headband', minutes: 10, name: 'Headband', say: 'A headband. It holds your head in. That is what they are for.', wear: true },\n  { id: 'sunhat', minutes: 15, name: 'Sunhat', say: 'A sunhat. For the sun. It is the same sun as before.', wear: true },\n  { id: 'bowtie', minutes: 20, name: 'Tiny bow tie', say: 'I am wearing a bow tie. It is because of your minutes. Please say nothing. Please notice.' },\n  { id: 'hat', minutes: 25, name: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\", say: \"Gertrude's spare hat. It is warm. She only took it off this morning.\", wear: true },\n  { id: 'friend', minutes: 30, name: \"Gerald's friend\", say: 'Gerald has a friend now. It is a smaller hippo. There is no explanation.' }\n];\n})();\nEOF\ncat > game/data/activities.js <<'EOF'\n/* data/activities.js: one row an activity. family: which code runs it (game/activities/). tiers: its numbers.\n * Add a tier or an activity from an existing family here, with no code. Rows become G.activity entries in runtime.js. */\n(() => {\nconst G = window.G;\nG.DATA.activities = [\n  /* ---- Stillness ---- */\n  { id: 'stork', family: 'hold', discipline: 'Stillness', name: 'Stork Stand', view: 'brawler', room: 'deck', music: 'yoga', class: true, hub: true, dur: 45, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Stand on one leg. Keep the dot in the ring. You can lean. You cannot leave.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [\n      { name: 'Stork Stand', set: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, pushV: .6, pushEvery: 7 }, ringEvery: 12, ringReach: .22, gull: { at: [15, 31], force: 2.5, stay: 6 }, poses: ['stork'] },\n      { name: 'Eyes Closed', blind: true, set: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, pushV: .7, pushEvery: 6 }, ringEvery: 99, ringReach: 0, gull: { at: [20], force: 2, stay: 6 }, poses: ['stork'], say: 'The same, with your eyes closed. Listen to the tone. Feel the shaking. Believe me.' }\n    ] },\n  { id: 'flow', family: 'hold', discipline: 'Stillness', name: 'Sun Flow', view: 'brawler', room: 'deck', music: 'yoga', dur: 80, stars: [.5, .75, .92], breath: true, mirror: true,\n    say: 'Five poses, two breaths each. Breathe with the ring. Hold still in between. You may not skip the Warrior.', controls: ['lean', 'breath'],\n    tiers: [\n      { name: 'Sun Flow', set: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, pushV: .5, pushEvery: 9 }, ringEvery: 16, ringReach: .12, poses: ['lunge', 'dog', 'triangle', 'warrior', 'stork'], breaths: [4, 4] },\n      { name: 'Long Exhale', set: { k: 11, c: 5, s: 10, A: 3.6, nf: 1.5, R: .22, pushV: .6, pushEvery: 7 }, ringEvery: 16, ringReach: .16, poses: ['fold', 'plank', 'dog', 'knee', 'warrior'], breaths: [3, 5], say: 'A shorter breath in, a longer breath out. It is the same breath, but you will notice it more.' }\n    ] },\n  { id: 'candle', family: 'candle', discipline: 'Stillness', name: 'Quiet Candle', view: 'brawler', room: 'deck', music: 'yoga', class: true, hub: true, dur: 60, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Sit. A candle burns. Move gently, or it goes out. Thoughts will push you. Do not follow them far.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [\n      { name: 'Quiet Candle', set: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, pushV: .55, pushEvery: 5 }, thoughtEvery: 9, thoughtForce: [3, 5] },\n      { name: 'Noisy Candle', set: { k: 10, c: 4.5, s: 13, A: 1.8, nf: .9, R: .18, pushV: .6, pushEvery: 4.5 }, thoughtEvery: 7, thoughtForce: [3.5, 5.5], extras: ['blender', 'goose'], say: 'The same candle. Today Dennis is using the blender. There is also a goose.' }\n    ] },\n  /* ---- Strength: one code path, three rows ---- */\n  { id: 'squat', family: 'rep', discipline: 'Strength', name: 'Squat Rail', view: 'brawler', room: 'iron', music: 'iron', class: true, hub: true, stars: [.35, .65, .90], axis: 'y', facing: 1.2,\n    clip: '22_14', top: 1.1, bottom: 1.72,\n    say: 'The bead rides the rail. Your lean is your knees. Go down with it, come up with it. Stay straight.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Squat Rail', reps: 8, down: 2, up: 2, hold: 0 }, { name: 'Slow Squat', reps: 12, down: 3, up: 1, hold: .8, say: 'Three seconds down. A hold. One second up. It has a name. The name is not polite.' } ] },\n  { id: 'pushup', family: 'rep', discipline: 'Strength', name: 'Push-Up', view: 'brawler', room: 'iron', music: 'iron', hub: true, stars: [.35, .65, .90], axis: 'y', facing: .1,\n    clip: 'Pushup', top: 0, bottomShare: .5,\n    say: 'Lower yourself as the bead lowers. Rise as it rises. The floor is not going anywhere.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Push-Up', reps: 6, down: 2, up: 2, hold: 0 }, { name: 'Slow Push-Up', reps: 10, down: 3, up: 1, hold: .8, say: 'Slower this time. I am told it builds character. I am a scale, and I have plenty.' } ] },\n  { id: 'lunge', family: 'rep', discipline: 'Strength', name: 'Side Lunge', view: 'brawler', room: 'iron', music: 'iron', stars: [.35, .65, .90], axis: 'x', facing: 1.57, bodyMove: 'sideLunge',\n    say: 'The bead swings left and right. Lean with it. Your feet stay where they are. That is the whole idea.', controls: ['lean'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Side Lunge', reps: 8, down: 2, up: 2, hold: 0 }, { name: 'Long Lunge', reps: 12, down: 3, up: 1, hold: .8, say: 'Further and slower. Your feet have been told. Please tell your knees.' } ] },\n  /* ---- Cardio ---- */\n  { id: 'step', family: 'step', discipline: 'Cardio', name: 'Step Class', view: 'brawler', room: 'pier', music: null, class: true, hub: true, dur: 60, stars: [.5, .75, .92],\n    say: 'Step on the beat. Left, right, left, right. Everyone behind you will follow. Nobody blames you.', controls: ['steps'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Step Class', chart: 'stepA', lanes: 2 }, { name: 'Step Class Two', chart: 'stepB', lanes: 4, say: 'All four directions. Faster. Please do not fall off the pier. We have only the one.' } ] },\n  { id: 'hoop', family: 'hoop', discipline: 'Cardio', name: 'Hoop Hips', view: 'brawler', room: 'pier', music: 'festival', class: true, hub: true, dur: 60, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Circle your lean to spin the hoop. Not too slow, not too eager. Catch the hoops they throw you.', controls: ['circle', 'catch'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Hoop Hips', tossEvery: 8, needMore: .3 }, { name: 'Hoop Hips Deluxe', tossEvery: 5.5, needMore: .6, swap: 2, say: 'More hoops, more often, and the direction will change twice. Mr. Okafor has been waiting for this.' } ] },\n  { id: 'jog', family: 'jog', discipline: 'Cardio', name: 'Coastal Jog', view: 'side', room: null, music: 'jog', hub: true, dur: 95, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: \"Left, right, left, right, at Marisol's pace. Lean to steer round the pigeons. Grab the water.\", controls: ['pace', 'steer'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Coastal Jog', length: 1, pigeons: 1, band: 1 }, { name: 'The Long Way', length: 1.25, pigeons: 1.8, band: .75, say: 'The same coast, more of it, and more pigeons. They have heard about you.' } ] },\n  /* ---- Balance games ---- */\n  { id: 'slalom', family: 'slalom', discipline: 'Balance', name: 'Mount Posture Slalom', short: 'Slalom', view: 'side', room: null, music: 'ski', hub: true, dur: 120, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Lean left and right through the gates. Forward to tuck. Back to brake. Please avoid the snowmen.', controls: ['ski'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Mount Posture Slalom', course: 0 }, { name: 'North Face', course: 1, say: 'Narrower gates, and fog. The North Face is the same mountain, only less friendly.' } ] },\n  { id: 'tray', family: 'tray', discipline: 'Balance', name: 'Tray Service', view: 'tray', room: null, music: 'tray', dur: 60, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Dennis needs olives in glasses. He cannot say why. Lean to tilt the tray and roll them in.', controls: ['tilt'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Tray Service', trays: 'trays', dur: 60, set: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 0, A: .25, nf: 1, R: .3 } }, { name: 'Evening Service', trays: 'traysHard', dur: 60, set: { k: 14, c: 6, s: 2, A: .6, nf: 1.3, R: .3 }, friction: .35, say: 'The same olives, but it is evening. The tray has more holes. Nobody knows who is doing that.' } ] },\n  { id: 'laundry', family: 'laundry', discipline: 'Balance', name: 'Laundry Line', view: 'side', room: null, music: 'laundry', dur: 118, stars: [.35, .65, .90],\n    say: 'Walk the line. Keep the dot in the ring. Hop over the pegs. The wind will warn you. Please walk on it.', controls: ['walk', 'leanx', 'jump'],\n    tiers: [ { name: 'Laundry Line', set: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, pushV: .9, pushEvery: 5 }, gust: 9, course: 0 }, { name: 'Windy Washday', set: { k: 10, c: 3.2, s: 18, A: 3.8, nf: 1.3, R: .36, pushV: 1, pushEvery: 4.5 }, gust: 11, course: 0, say: 'A windier day. It is also Monday, which is when the big sheets go out.' } ] }\n];\n// (the Body Check's set, and the Gentle Games' short versions, live with their scenes' data)\nG.DATA.bodyCheck = { set: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20 } };\n})();\nEOF\nsed -n 4690,4726p engine/my-3d2dge.js | grep -n \"HUMANOID_HATS\\|cap:\\|band:\" | cut -c1-500 | head; grep -n \"const HUMANOID_HATS\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | cut -c1-200; L=$(grep -n \"const HUMANOID_HATS\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"$L,$((L+6))p\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | cut -c1-600; grep -n \"draw.over\\|o.draw\\b\\|\\.draw\\.over\\|draw.under\" engine/my-3d2dge.js | head -5 | cut -c1-300","description":"Write the game data files and check hat internals"}}}
