{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjEq2rEfJryvhLp9BhRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J6efnmRvo1QJcGNdwkZz9g","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Notes (session 1)\n- Dev folder holds everything; build: `node build.mjs`; tests: `node tests/run.mjs` (to be written); shots in shots/ (remove at end).\n- Lean model validated against plan table (tests/tools/bands.mjs).\n- Written so far: core, balance, rigs, art, ui, audio, data/*, activities: runtime, hold, candle, rep, step. scenes: session, title; main.js.\n- Remaining families: hoop, jog, slalom, tray, laundry. Scenes: attract, member, arrival, island, bodycheck, evening, tareday, games, ending, about, class, round, freeplay; dev.js.\nEOF\nsed -n 60,110p engine/modules/mode7.js | cut -c1-200 | grep -n \"rig(\\|  add(\\|  sprite(\\|  draw(\\|view(k\" ; grep -n \"  rig(rig\\|  view(k\\|  add(x, y, z\" engine/modules/mode7.js | cut -c1-260; L=$(grep -n \"  rig(rig\" engine/modules/mode7.js | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"$L,$((L+3))p\" engine/modules/mode7.js | cut -c1-300; L=$(grep -n \"  view(k\" engine/modules/mode7.js | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"$L,$((L+6))p\" engine/modules/mode7.js | cut -c1-300; sed -n 295,304p engine/kits/kart.js | cut -c1-280; sed -n 105,150p engine/modules/road.js | cut -c1-200 | grep -n \"ahead\\|project\\|draw(r\" ","description":"Save progress and read how rigs draw in Mode 7 and Road"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31391,"cache_read_input_tokens":339682,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31391},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4