{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ADAL8NRWw1dZa6u1kpozTT","type":"tool_result","content":"## 7. Cast and voice\n\n**Tone rules.** Short sentences. Sincere, polite, a little too personal. Translated-instruction-manual cadence. No sarcasm, no meanness, no profanity, no pop-culture jokes, no references to being a game. Praise that wobbles. Facts nobody asked for. Tare is needy but never says so outright. Every text box: at most 2 lines of about 60 characters; a line is one thought. Use these lines verbatim and write as many more in the same voice as the game needs (aim for 150+ total, so a second playthrough still surprises). All text lives in `game/data/lines.js`.\n\ntests/run.mjs:11:const STEM = 'WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037';\ntests/run.mjs:299:    const banned = /\\b(damn|hell|crap|stupid|idiot|loser|lol|dude|player|video game|level up|npc|pixel|save file|achievement|netflix|instagram|tiktok|fitbit|google)\\b/i; for (const t of strings) check('tone: ' + t.slice(0,\ntests/run.mjs:315:  check('no source names in game text', !/\\b(Wii|Mii|Balance Board|Nintendo)\\b/.test(allText), (allText.match(/\\b(Wii|Mii|Balance Board|Nintendo)\\b/) || [])[0]);\ntests/run.mjs:317:  check('font tiny is banned', !/font: 'tiny'/.test(allText));\ntests/plan.mjs:12:  const L = G.DATA.lines, html = readFileSync(join(root, '..', 'WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037.html'), 'utf8');\ntests/plan.mjs:58:  /* §7 the tone rules, by machine: short sentences, no game talk, no body talk, no pop culture, no profanity */\ntests/plan.mjs:62:    for (const k in bad) { const hits = strings.filter(s => bad[k].test(s)); check('§7 tone: no ' + k + ' words', !hits.length, hits.slice(0, 3)); } }\ntests/plan.mjs:91:  check('§14 session tags in order', /<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\\s*<script>\\/\\*! aihub-session[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>\\s*<meta name=\"viewport\"[^>]*>\\s*<title>[^<]*<\\/title>\\s*<meta name=\"description\"[^>]*>\\s*<meta name=\"theme-color\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4-8818-8a6b8bcd7047","uuid":"e7f31250-e175-4100-928c-53909f4e123d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:14:09.919Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## 7. Cast and voice\n\n**Tone rules.** Short sentences. Sincere, polite, a little too personal. Translated-instruction-manual cadence. No sarcasm, no meanness, no profanity, no pop-culture jokes, no references to being a game. Praise that wobbles. Facts nobody asked for. Tare is needy but never says so outright. Every text box: at most 2 lines of about 60 characters; a line is one thought. Use these lines verbatim and write as many more in the same voice as the game needs (aim for 150+ total, so a second playthrough still surprises). All text lives in `game/data/lines.js`.\n\ntests/run.mjs:11:const STEM = 'WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037';\ntests/run.mjs:299:    const banned = /\\b(damn|hell|crap|stupid|idiot|loser|lol|dude|player|video game|level up|npc|pixel|save file|achievement|netflix|instagram|tiktok|fitbit|google)\\b/i; for (const t of strings) check('tone: ' + t.slice(0,\ntests/run.mjs:315:  check('no source names in game text', !/\\b(Wii|Mii|Balance Board|Nintendo)\\b/.test(allText), (allText.match(/\\b(Wii|Mii|Balance Board|Nintendo)\\b/) || [])[0]);\ntests/run.mjs:317:  check('font tiny is banned', !/font: 'tiny'/.test(allText));\ntests/plan.mjs:12:  const L = G.DATA.lines, html = readFileSync(join(root, '..', 'WeeTeeter-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-221037.html'), 'utf8');\ntests/plan.mjs:58:  /* §7 the tone rules, by machine: short sentences, no game talk, no body talk, no pop culture, no profanity */\ntests/plan.mjs:62:    for (const k in bad) { const hits = strings.filter(s => bad[k].test(s)); check('§7 tone: no ' + k + ' words', !hits.length, hits.slice(0, 3)); } }\ntests/plan.mjs:91:  check('§14 session tags in order', /<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\\s*<script>\\/\\*! aihub-session[