{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019vyFK8RZeeFQ7Xa4fxPP7P","type":"tool_result","content":"154:**Coastal Jog** (`jog`, `E.Road`; copy `engine/kits/road.js`). Alternate L2/R2 (J/K; left/right buttons) to set a cadence; lean steers. Stay in Marisol's pacing zone (cadence band 2.6 to 3.4 steps/s, shown as a calm gauge). Sprint over 4.2 for 2 s and you get a Stitch (3 s hobble). Weave round pigeons and other joggers, grab water cups. About 70 s for a lap. `pct` = .7 time in zone + .3 cups. Rig: `Run_Loop` scal\n271:- **Marisol**, headband, always moving: \"Morning! I've already done today. I'm on to tomorrow.\"\n\n== passive/average/good, time, errors\ntests/run.mjs:50:${id}:${tier} passive under 1 star\ntests/run.mjs:52:${id}:${tier} average at least 1 star\ntests/run.mjs:52:${id}:${tier} good at least 2 stars\ntests/run.mjs:53:${id}:${tier} good at least 1 star\ntests/run.mjs:238:${id} on ${dev}: an average person earns a star\n\n== playthrough\n\n== saves\ntests/run.mjs:65:reload gives the same state\ntests/run.mjs:66:members stay separate\ntests/run.mjs:67:three member slots\ntests/run.mjs:72:a damaged save does not crash the card screen\ntests/run.mjs:73:a damaged save does not crash the title\n\n== same hash\ntests/run.mjs:80:same seed, same input, same hash\ntests/run.mjs:156:hub: same seed, same deal\n\n== dev\ntests/plan.mjs:77:§13 slider exists: \ntests/browser.py:120:the voice slider applies\ntests/run.mjs:100:slider changes \ntests/run.mjs:101:reset restores all\ntests/run.mjs:102:dev jump loads \n\n== class+hub fake\ntests/plan.mjs:91:§14 podium titles\ntests/run.mjs:131:class reaches the podium with four scores\ntests/run.mjs:132:the podium has polite titles\ntests/run.mjs:153:hub: time-up reports once\ntests/run.mjs:154:hub: end stops sending\n\n== lint\ntests/run.mjs:285:pose clip exists: \ntests/run.mjs:312:no TODO or placeholder: \ntests/plan.mjs:77:§13 slider exists: \n\n== check.mjs\ntests/browser.py:28:engine check.mjs passes\n\n== stand-in pad\ntests/browser.py:41:prompts show Cross\ntests/browser.py:44:Settings to Xbox shows A\n\n== keys+mouse\ntests/browser.py:80:hover moves focus in Pills\ntests/browser.py:82:a click activates\ntests/browser.py:88:hover moves focus in the HTML menus\ntests/browser.py:93:WASD nudges\ntests/browser.py:95:the lean prompt names WASD\n\n== touch\ntests/browser.py:130:a phone is told a controller or keyboard is needed\ntests/browser.py:134:attract starts at 10 s behind the notice\ntests/browser.py:137:no errors on a phone\ntests/browser.py:143:WebKit iPhone reaches the title\ntests/browser.py:143:no errors on WebKit\n\n== sound\ntests/browser.py:112:the music bus sounds\ntests/browser.py:113:the voice bus sounds during dialog\ntests/browser.py:115:OfflineAudioContext renders babble\ntests/browser.py:122:no network requests and no audio files\n\n== hub\ntests/hub.py:33:harness \ntests/hub.py:34:two copies see each other as ghosts\ntests/hub.py:43:the game on its own reaches the title\ntests/hub.py:43:no errors on its own\ntests/run.mjs:131:class reaches the podium with four scores\n\n== M4 beat audible\ntests/browser.py:82:a click activates\ntests/browser.py:105:a click on the ground walks\ntests/browser.py:118:the beat is on the sfx bus at default volume\n\n== M8 polish\ntests/browser.py:55:rumble reaches the controller\ngame/rigs.js:127:    colors: { skin: W.a, hair: W.b, cloth: W.a, coat: W.a, pants: W.b, boot: W.b, belt: W.c, \ngame/scenes/games.js:28:    G.say('gertrude', won ? G.DATA.lines.gertrudeWin : G.DATA.lines.gertrudeLose, { on\ngame/scenes/evening.js:13:      phase = 'night'; t = 0; poser.clip('Sleeping', { loop: true, tgt: 1.57, fade: \ngame/ui.js:158:    if (k > this.shown && this.shown < this.stars) { this.shown++; G.A.sfx('stamp'); game.shake\ngame/activities/hold.js:19:      c.bal.onStumble = () => { c.fellT = 1; if (G.cue(ctx, c)) { G.A.sfx('stumble'\ngame/activities/hold.js:76:      if (ctx.tone && c.local && !ctx.quiet