{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018FvFc483se2cZ8tW6Z6j1T","type":"tool_result","content":"§6 motto on signs            scenes/title.js:1 scenes/ending.js:1 scenes/island.js:1 scenes/arrival.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§6/§8 morning .92            art.js:1 rigs.js:1 scenes/round.js:1 activities/slalom.js:1 activities/hoop.js:1\n§8 dusk .62                  art.js:1 rigs.js:1 activities/laundry.js:2 activities/candle.js:1\n§3 hide cursor               scenes/session.js:1 scenes/member.js:2 activities/runtime.js:2\n§3 soft hand                 *** NONE\n§3 creak near edge           scenes/tareday.js:1 activities/rep.js:1 activities/runtime.js:1\n§3 chime climbs              audio.js:2 art.js:4 scenes/bodycheck.js:6 activities/runtime.js:6\n§3 glints                    art.js:1 scenes/island.js:4 activities/hoop.js:1 activities/hold.js:1 activities/tray.js:1\n§3 rig flails                activities/hold.js:1\n§3 rumble harder             ui.js:1 activities/slalom.js:2 activities/rep.js:1 activities/hoop.js:2 activities/laundry.js:2\n§4 mirrors on next mat       art.js:3 activities/hold.js:1 data/activities.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§4 candle blender+goose      audio.js:1 activities/candle.js:7 data/activities.js:1 data/lines.js:5\n§4 step Regulars behind      audio.js:3 rigs.js:1 scenes/attract.js:2 scenes/island.js:4 scenes/class.js:3\n§4 counts in gibberish       audio.js:1 dev.js:1 ui.js:1 scenes/session.js:5 scenes/evening.js:1\n§4 onBeat click              activities/step.js:1\n§4 Okafor cheers             audio.js:2 rigs.js:1 scenes/attract.js:1 scenes/ending.js:1 activities/hoop.js:1\n§4 jog Lou bench             audio.js:1 rigs.js:1 scenes/ending.js:1 scenes/island.js:3 data/island.js:1\n§4 other joggers             activities/jog.js:7 data/courses.js:1\n§4 snow weather              scenes/island.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§4 Regulars' times           activities/slalom.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§5 flower                    art.js:2 scenes/island.js:1\n§5 graph dots                art.js:1 activities/laundry.js:1\n§5 coins fly                 rigs.js:3 ui.js:9 scenes/evening.js:2\n§10 grunts                   audio.js:2 scenes/bodycheck.js:1 scenes/session.js:1 activities/rep.js:1\n§8 title font                art.js:5 dev.js:1 ui.js:13 scenes/games.js:1 scenes/attract.js:1\n§8 store assets              scenes/about.js:1\n§8 E.Blob                    activities/runtime.js:1\n§12 DEMO chip                scenes/attract.js:1\n§12 press any button         scenes/attract.js:2\n§13 default vs current       audio.js:33 rigs.js:1 core.js:28 dev.js:8 ui.js:19\n§13 pointer over panel       balance.js:1 dev.js:1 activities/runtime.js:3\n§13 L1/R1 coarse             balance.js:4 core.js:5 dev.js:8 ui.js:1 activities/hoop.js:4\n§14 Surprise me              scenes/class.js:1\n§14 PLAYER_COLORS            scenes/attract.js:1 scenes/class.js:4\n§14 progress                 scenes/round.js:1\n§14 Math.random              rigs.js:1\n§8 mannequin joints          rigs.js:1 activities/hold.js:1\n§4 flying sock               activities/laundry.js:14\n§4 hamper                    activities/laundry.js:3\n§4 gecko                     activities/tray.js:18 data/trays.js:1\n§4 Perfect/Good/Late         activities/rep.js:1 activities/step.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§4 Too slow                  activities/hoop.js:2\n§7 8 faces                   rigs.js:1 dev.js:1 scenes/bodycheck.js:1 activities/candle.js:2\n§8 lanterns                  art.js:5\n§8 dumbbell                  art.js:5\n§8 water cooler              art.js:2\n§8 brochure                  art.js:1\n§8 wind chimes               art.js:4\n§8 ferns                     art.js:11 activities/tray.js:1\n  cards: {\n    'stork': 'Stand on one leg. Keep the dot in the ring. You can lean. You cannot leave.',\n    'Eyes Closed': 'The same, with your eyes closed. Listen to the tone. Feel the shaking. Believe me.',\n    'flow': 'Five poses, two breaths each. Breathe with the ring. Hold still in between. You may not skip the Warrior.',\n    'Long Exhale': 'A shorter breath in, a longer breath out. It is the same breath, but you will notice it more.',\n    'candle': 'Sit. A candle burns. Move gently, or it goes out. Thoughts will push you. Do not follow them far.',\n    'Noisy Candle': 'The same candle. Today Dennis is using the blender. There is also a goose.',\n    'squat': 'The bead rides the rail. Your lean is your knees. Go down with it, come up with it. Stay straight.',\n    'Slow Squat': 'Three seconds down. A hold. One second up. It has a name. The name is not polite.',\n    'pushup': 'Lower yourself as the bead lowers. Rise as it rises. The floor is not going anywhere.',\n    'Slow Push-Up': 'Slower this time. I am told it builds character. I am a scale, and I have plenty.',\n    'lunge': 'The bead swings left and right. Lean with it. Your feet stay where they are. That is the whole idea.',\n    'Long Lunge': 'Further and slower. Your feet have been told. Please tell your knees.',\n    'step': 'Step on the beat. Left, right, left, right. Everyone behind you will follow. Nobody blames you.',\n    'Step Class Two': 'All four directions. Faster. Please do not fall off the pier. We have only the one.',\n    'hoop': 'Circle your lean to spin the hoop. Not too slow, not too eager. Catch the hoops they throw you.',\n    'Hoop Hips Deluxe': 'More hoops, more often, and the direction will change twice. Mr. Okafor has been waiting for this.',\n    'jog': \"Left, right, left, right, at Marisol's pace. Lean to steer round the pigeons. Grab the water.\",\n    'The Long Way': 'The same coast, more of it, and more pigeons. They have heard about you.',\n    'slalom': 'Lean left and right through the gates. Forward to tuck. Back to brake. Please avoid the snowmen.',\n    'North Face': 'Narrower gates, and fog. The North Face is the same mountain, only less friendly.',\n    'tray': 'Dennis needs olives in glasses. He cannot say why. Lean to tilt the tray and roll them in.',\n    'Evening Service': 'The same olives, but it is evening. The tray has more holes. Nobody knows who is doing that.',\n    'laundry': 'Walk the line. Keep the dot in the ring. Hop over the pegs. The wind will warn you. Please walk on it.',\n    'Windy Washday': 'A windier day. It is also Monday, which is when the big sheets go out.'\n  },","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e35d4c2a-4185-48d4-8818-8a6b8bcd7047","uuid":"0decc97c-c937-4944-b024-2985ba475fca","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:23:42.366Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"§6 motto on signs            scenes/title.js:1 scenes/ending.js:1 scenes/island.js:1 scenes/arrival.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§6/§8 morning .92            art.js:1 rigs.js:1 scenes/round.js:1 activities/slalom.js:1 activities/hoop.js:1\n§8 dusk .62                  art.js:1 rigs.js:1 activities/laundry.js:2 activities/candle.js:1\n§3 hide cursor               scenes/session.js:1 scenes/member.js:2 activities/runtime.js:2\n§3 soft hand                 *** NONE\n§3 creak near edge           scenes/tareday.js:1 activities/rep.js:1 activities/runtime.js:1\n§3 chime climbs              audio.js:2 art.js:4 scenes/bodycheck.js:6 activities/runtime.js:6\n§3 glints                    art.js:1 scenes/island.js:4 activities/hoop.js:1 activities/hold.js:1 activities/tray.js:1\n§3 rig flails                activities/hold.js:1\n§3 rumble harder             ui.js:1 activities/slalom.js:2 activities/rep.js:1 activities/hoop.js:2 activities/laundry.js:2\n§4 mirrors on next mat       art.js:3 activities/hold.js:1 data/activities.js:1 data/lines.js:1\n§4 candle blender+goose      audio.js:1 activities/candle.js:7 data/activities.js:1 data/lines.js:5\n§4 step Regulars behind      audio.js:3 rigs.js:1 scenes/attract.js:2 scenes/island.js:4 scenes/class.js:3\n§4 counts in gibberish       audio.js:1 dev.js:1 ui.js:1 scenes/session.js:5 scenes/evening.js:1\n§4 onBeat click              activities/step.js:1\n§4 Okafor cheers    