{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjhnRyaiY2gZ2w2LQAAc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Section 18 is now matched line by line against the final build, and every line is backed by checks.** The three lines that also ask for a judgment are met as far as this computer can show. I changed nothing this round: the hash is still `ca3f3f6b494bcb9f…`, the last full run was 2607 passed, 0 failed, and `plan --list` just printed 743 passed, 0 failed on this build.\n\n| # | Section 18 line | Result | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Title, single file, dev folder | Done | Hand-in check: file in root, dev folder, opens as \"Wee Teeter\" |\n| 2 | Original game | **Partly judgment** | \"Wii\" appears only in the 3 source fields the plan requires; melodies tested against the songbook. Whether the look copies the source is my judgment |\n| 3 | Genre, perspective, engine | Done | 14 section 1 checks; engine 0.89.0; the one engine change is noted |\n| 4 | Art and animation | Done | 25 section 8 and 33 section 9 checks; 1080p screenshots |\n| 5 | Audio, gibberish voices, 10% music | Done | 28 section 10 checks; browser audio probes; hand-in check for 10% |\n| 6 | Hub session, local Class | Done | Harness checks at all 5 settings, ghosts seen in two copies, runs on its own, Class podium |\n| 7 | Every feature, real systems, designer data | Done | Good-bot and passive playthroughs; data-only tests add content with no code |\n| 8 | Dev Mode | Done | 51 section 13 checks; sliders change, reset restores, jumps load |\n| 9 | Attract | Done | Hand-in check: starts after 10 s idle, any input returns to the title; playlist checks |\n| 10 | Writing tone | **Partly judgment** | 158 section 7 checks, and I read every string against the rules. Whether it's funny is my judgment |\n| 11 | 10-foot, controller-first, native keys and mouse | **Partly judgment** | 28 section 11 checks, plus hover, prompt and whole-day device